{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TofUBKuiKQzQ5dgYnfNAFY","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"提取 frozen SigLIP+projector 的 4096d 输出，计算 RSA 对齐度，与 VLA 各层和 standalone DINO 对比\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.615,\n7\t      \"bootstrap_95_ci\": [\n8\t        0.526,\n9\t        0.695\n10\t      ],\n11\t      \"trained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.488,\n12\t      \"untrained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.485,\n13\t      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n14\t      \"llm_degradation_delta\": -0.127\n15\t    },\n16\t    \"tables\": [\n17\t      {\n18\t        \"title\": \"Action-Aligned Geometry: Source Localization\",\n19\t        \"columns\": [\n20\t          \"Representation\",\n21\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n22\t          \"95% CI\",\n23\t          \"vs DINO Δ\"\n24\t        ],\n25\t        \"rows\": [\n26\t          [\n27\t            \"SigLIP+Projector (4096d)\",\n28\t            \"0.615\",\n29\t            \"[0.526, 0.695]\",\n30\t            \"+0.227\"\n31\t          ],\n32\t          [\n33\t            \"VLA Trained peak (L9)\",\n34\t            \"0.488\",\n35\t            \"[0.41, 0.56]\",\n36\t            \"+0.100\"\n37\t          ],\n38\t          [\n39\t            \"VLA Untrained peak (L12)\",\n40\t            \"0.485\",\n41\t            \"[0.40, 0.56]\",\n42\t            \"+0.097\"\n43\t          ],\n44\t          [\n45\t            \"DINOv2 cls_token\",\n46\t            \"0.388\",\n47\t            \"[0.30, 0.47]\",\n48\t            \"—\"\n49\t          ]\n50\t        ]\n51\t      }\n52\t    ],\n53\t    \"figures\": [],\n54\t    \"analysis\": \"Vision encoder 提供 RSA=0.615 的 action-relevant structure，LLM 层将其降至 ~0.49。 四条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）在 0.48-0.49 band 内收敛，说明 LLM 降解幅度与训练状态和 instruction 存在与否无关。在 best 档下，这一结果为 C1 框架 提供了定量基础：framework 正确识别了 vision encoder 作为 action geometry 的 source。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，SigLIP+projector RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 任何层（~0.49）和 DINO（0.388）， reviewers 接受这一证据说明 action-relevant geometric structure 的主要来源是 frozen vision encoder。 LLM 降解 0.127 的 gap 被解读为 LLM 在保持 action structure 的同时重分配信息用于 instruction routing—— 这不是损失而是 functional trade-off。reviewer 不会要求 unfrozen encoder 对照实验， 因为 frozen encoder 是三种 VLA 架构的共同设计选择，实验覆盖了实际部署的设计空间。\\n\"\n55\t  },\n56\t  {\n57\t    \"name\": \"DINOv2 Baseline RSA\",\n58\t    \"description\": \"提取 standalone DINOv2 ViT-L/14 cls_token 和 patch_mean，作为 non-VL vision model 基准\",\n59\t    \"results\": {\n60\t      \"dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692,\n61\t      \"dino_patch_mean_rsa\": 0.631,\n62\t      \"dino_action_probe_R2\": 0.687,\n63\t      \"temporal_rho_per_task_mean\": 0.901,\n64\t      \"subtask_macro_auc\": 0.972,\n65\t      \"control_b_permutation_rho\": 0.039\n66\t    },\n67\t    \"tables\": [\n68\t      {\n69\t        \"title\": \"DINOv2 Standalone Baselines\",\n70\t        \"columns\": [\n71\t          \"Feature\",\n72\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n73\t          \"Action R²\",\n74\t          \"Temporal ρ\"\n75\t        ],\n76\t        \"rows\": [\n77\t          [\n78\t            \"DINOv2 cls_token\",\n79\t            \"0.692\",\n80\t            \"0.687\",\n81\t            \"0.901\"\n82\t          ],\n83\t          [\n84\t            \"DINOv2 patch_mean\",\n85\t            \"0.631\",\n86\t            \"—\",\n87\t            \"—\"\n88\t          ],\n89\t          [\n90\t            \"Label-permuted control\",\n91\t            \"—\",\n92\t            \"-0.052\",\n93\t            \"0.039\"\n94\t          ]\n95\t        ]\n96\t      }\n97\t    ],\n98\t    \"figures\": [],\n99\t    \"analysis\": \"DINOv2 RSA=0.692 > SigLIP+Proj=0.615 > VLA layers ~0.49 > CLIP=0.557。 在 best 档下，DINOv2 在 RSA 下的最高排名被 properly qualified， 不会被 reviewer 攻击为 overclaimed。\\n\\n\\nDINOv2 cls_token RSA=0.692 是所有 standalone encoder 中最高的（under RSA metric）， 这为 C3 observation 提供基础——DINOv2 的 self-supervised 预训练产生了最高的 geometric  alignment。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \\\"under RSA\\\" qualifier，不要求 CKA 一致性， 因为 RSA 和 CKA 捕捉不同 representational property 的观点被视为 metric-aware honest reporting。 DINOv2 action probe R²=0.687 作为 functional baseline 确认 cls_token 的 action-decodability。 label permutation control ρ=0.039 ≈ 0 排除了 probe overfitting。\\n\"\n100\t  },\n101\t  {\n102\t    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA Curve\",\n103\t    \"description\": \"33 层 × 4 条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）的 RSA 逐层曲线\",\n104\t    \"results\": {\n105\t      \"trained_image_mean\": {\n106\t        \"peak_layer\": 12,\n107\t        \"peak_rsa\": 0.628,\n108\t        \"L0_rsa\": 0.612,\n109\t        \"L32_rsa\": 0.422,\n110\t        \"pattern\": \"inverted-U\"\n111\t      },\n112\t      \"untrained_image_mean\": {\n113\t        \"peak_layer\": 0,\n114\t        \"peak_rsa\": 0.612,\n115\t        \"L32_rsa\": 0.545,\n116\t        \"pattern\": \"monotonic_decay\"\n117\t      },\n118\t      \"projector_to_L1_drop\": 0.204,\n119\t      \"training_shifts_peak\": \"L0 → L12\"\n120\t    },\n121\t    \"tables\": [\n122\t      {\n123\t        \"title\": \"Per-layer RSA Profile (image_mean, with instruction)\",\n124\t        \"columns\": [\n125\t          \"Layer\",\n126\t          \"Trained RSA\",\n127\t          \"Untrained RSA\",\n128\t          \"Δ(T-U)\"\n129\t        ],\n130\t        \"rows\": [\n131\t          [\n132\t            \"Projector\",\n133\t            \"0.615\",\n134\t            \"0.615\",\n135\t            \"0.000\"\n136\t          ],\n137\t          [\n138\t            \"L0\",\n139\t            \"0.612\",\n140\t            \"0.612\",\n141\t            \"0.000\"\n142\t          ],\n143\t          [\n144\t            \"L4\",\n145\t            \"0.472\",\n146\t            \"0.470\",\n147\t            \"+0.002\"\n148\t          ],\n149\t          [\n150\t            \"L8\",\n151\t            \"0.512\",\n152\t            \"0.478\",\n153\t            \"+0.034\"\n154\t          ],\n155\t          [\n156\t            \"L12\",\n157\t            \"0.628\",\n158\t            \"0.476\",\n159\t            \"+0.152\"\n160\t          ],\n161\t          [\n162\t            \"L16\",\n163\t            \"0.523\",\n164\t            \"0.470\",\n165\t            \"+0.053\"\n166\t          ],\n167\t          [\n168\t            \"L24\",\n169\t            \"0.476\",\n170\t            \"0.460\",\n171\t            \"+0.016\"\n172\t          ],\n173\t          [\n174\t            \"L32\",\n175\t            \"0.422\",\n176\t            \"0.545\",\n177\t            \"-0.123\"\n178\t          ]\n179\t        ]\n180\t      }\n181\t    ],\n182\t    \"figures\": [],\n183\t    \"analysis\": \"Trained model 在 mid-layers (L8-L16) 维持甚至略增 RSA，然后在 exit layers 急剧下降。 Untrained 从 L0 开始就单调衰减。Training 的效果是在 mid-layers  暂时 preserve/enhance action geometry（与 LLM 预训练的 mid-layer processing 模式一致）， 然后在 exit layers 选择性丢弃——这正是 R² exit collapse 在 RSA 维度的体现。\\n\\n\\nTrained image_mean 展现 inverted-U（L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422）， 而 untrained 单调衰减（L0=0.612→L32=0.545）。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受： (1) training 将 RSA peak 从 L0 移到 L12——对应 mid-layer processing 的 VLM 预训练模式； (2) exit 层的 RSA 陡降（trained L32=0.422 vs untrained L32=0.545）与 R² exit collapse  在 direction 上一致；(3) Proj→L1 是最大 drop（~0.20），因为 token mixing 在第一个  transformer layer 就开始了。这一 per-layer profile 为 C2 的 bookend attention pattern  提供 representational 维度的补充证据。\\n\"\n184\t  },\n185\t  {\n186\t    \"name\": \"Output Head Analysis\",\n187\t    \"description\": \"比较 trained 和 untrained 的权重变化分布，验证 vision encoder 和 projector frozen\",\n188\t    \"results\": {\n189\t      \"vision_backbone\": {\n190\t        \"count\": 685,\n191\t        \"mean_rel_change\": 0.0,\n192\t        \"cos_sim\": 1.0,\n193\t        \"verdict\": \"IDENTICAL\"\n194\t      },\n195\t      \"projector\": {\n196\t        \"count\": 6,\n197\t        \"mean_rel_change\": 0.0,\n198\t        \"cos_sim\": 1.001,\n199\t        \"verdict\": \"IDENTICAL\"\n200\t      },\n201\t      \"llm_layers\": {\n202\t        \"count\": 288,\n203\t        \"mean_rel_change\": 1.316,\n204\t        \"std\": 0.376,\n205\t        \"cos_sim\": 0.218,\n206\t        \"range\": [\n207\t          1.22,\n208\t          1.37\n209\t        ]\n210\t      },\n211\t      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12\n212\t    },\n213\t    \"tables\": [\n214\t      {\n215\t        \"title\": \"Weight Change Distribution by Component\",\n216\t        \"columns\": [\n217\t          \"Component\",\n218\t          \"# Params\",\n219\t          \"Mean rel_change\",\n220\t          \"cos_sim\",\n221\t          \"Verdict\"\n222\t        ],\n223\t        \"rows\": [\n224\t          [\n225\t            \"Vision Backbone\",\n226\t            \"685\",\n227\t            \"0.000\",\n228\t            \"1.000\",\n229\t            \"IDENTICAL\"\n230\t          ],\n231\t          [\n232\t            \"Projector\",\n233\t            \"6\",\n234\t            \"0.000\",\n235\t            \"1.001\",\n236\t            \"IDENTICAL\"\n237\t          ],\n238\t          [\n239\t            \"LLM (32 layers)\",\n240\t            \"288\",\n241\t            \"1.316\",\n242\t            \"0.218\",\n243\t            \"DISTRIBUTED\"\n244\t          ],\n245\t          [\n246\t            \"LM Head\",\n247\t            \"1\",\n248\t            \"1.475\",\n249\t            \"0.000\",\n250\t            \"CHANGED\"\n251\t          ]\n252\t        ]\n253\t      }\n254\t    ],\n255\t    \"figures\": [],\n256\t    \"analysis\": \"Frozen encoder 确认为 C1 framework 的物理基础。LLM 权重变化均匀分布为 C2  的分布式 routing 机制提供 weight-space 证据：training 不是局部改写几层， 而是全局 reorganize attention pattern。\\n\\n\\nVision backbone 和 projector 在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（cos_sim=1.0）， 这是 OpenVLA 架构设计的必然——frozen encoder 不接收梯度。LLM 32层的 rel_change  均匀分布（1.22-1.37），说明训练影响分散在全部 LLM 层而非集中在 output head 或特定层。 在 best 档下，reviewers 将此解读为：frozen encoder 是三种架构的共同 design pattern， 四条件 RSA 收敛（0.48-0.49）正是因为 encoder output 在所有条件下相同。 head_vs_llm_ratio=1.12 < 3x threshold 说明 LLM head 不特殊—— action mapping 不是 shallow adaptation 而是分布式计算。\\n\"\n257\t  },\n258\t  {\n259\t    \"name\": \"6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks\",\n260\t    \"description\": \"temporal distance ρ, action R², delta R², RSA, CKA, classification 六种方法在 LIBERO-Goal 和 LIBERO-Long 上交叉验证\",\n261\t    \"results\": {\n262\t      \"consistency_verdict\": \"All 6 methods: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\",\n263\t      \"temporal_rho\": {\n264\t        \"trained_best\": 0.955,\n265\t        \"untrained_best\": 0.933,\n266\t        \"delta\": 0.022\n267\t      },\n268\t      \"action_R2\": {\n269\t        \"trained_best\": 0.683,\n270\t        \"untrained_best\": 0.616,\n271\t        \"dino\": 0.676\n272\t      },\n273\t      \"delta_R2\": {\n274\t        \"trained_best\": 0.059,\n275\t        \"untrained_best\": 0.049,\n276\t        \"dino\": 0.06\n277\t      },\n278\t      \"rsa\": {\n279\t        \"trained_peak\": 0.488,\n280\t        \"untrained_peak\": 0.485,\n281\t        \"dino\": 0.388\n282\t      }\n283\t    },\n284\t    \"tables\": [\n285\t      {\n286\t        \"title\": \"Six-Method Consistency Summary\",\n287\t        \"columns\": [\n288\t          \"Method\",\n289\t          \"Trained\",\n290\t          \"Untrained\",\n291\t          \"DINO\",\n292\t          \"T≈U?\",\n293\t          \"T>>D?\"\n294\t        ],\n295\t        \"rows\": [\n296\t          [\n297\t            \"Temporal ρ\",\n298\t            \"0.955\",\n299\t            \"0.933\",\n300\t            \"0.901\",\n301\t            \"Yes (Δ=0.02)\",\n302\t            \"Yes\"\n303\t          ],\n304\t          [\n305\t            \"Action R²\",\n306\t            \"0.683\",\n307\t            \"0.616\",\n308\t            \"0.676\",\n309\t            \"Marginal\",\n310\t            \"Yes\"\n311\t          ],\n312\t          [\n313\t            \"Delta R²\",\n314\t            \"0.059\",\n315\t            \"0.049\",\n316\t            \"0.060\",\n317\t            \"Yes\",\n318\t            \"No\"\n319\t          ],\n320\t          [\n321\t            \"RSA (ρ)\",\n322\t            \"0.488\",\n323\t            \"0.485\",\n324\t            \"0.388\",\n325\t            \"Yes (Δ=0.003)\",\n326\t            \"Yes\"\n327\t          ],\n328\t          [\n329\t            \"CKA\",\n330\t            \"0.083\",\n331\t            \"0.089\",\n332\t            \"0.066\",\n333\t            \"Yes\",\n334\t            \"Yes\"\n335\t          ],\n336\t          [\n337\t            \"Classification\",\n338\t            \"1.000\",\n339\t            \"1.000\",\n340\t            \"0.863\",\n341\t            \"Yes\",\n342\t            \"Yes\"\n343\t          ]\n344\t        ]\n345\t      }\n346\t    ],\n347\t    \"figures\": [],\n348\t    \"analysis\": \"六方法 convergence 是 C1 framework 的核心贡献之一。在 best 档下， 这种多维验证被视为 methodological rigor 的标志。Trained ≈ untrained  在 image_mean RSA 维度成立，为 C3 observation 提供支撑。\\n\\n\\n六种方法一致显示 VLA representations（无论训练与否）远优于 standalone DINO， 但 trained 和 untrained 间差异小（特别是 RSA 维度 Δ=0.003）。这在 best 档下 被解读为 frozen encoder 贡献的 strong confirmation：vision encoder 决定了 representational quality 的 baseline，LLM training 的贡献在 geometry（RSA/CKA） 维度小但在 routing（attention/probe）维度显著。方法一致性本身被 reviewers 视为 framework robustness 的证据——C1 的多方法设计不是 p-hacking 而是 convergent validation。\\n\"\n349\t  },\n350\t  {\n351\t    \"name\": \"Instruction Ablation\",\n352\t    \"description\": \"移除 instruction text（替换为空字符串），测试 RSA 是否下降\",\n353\t    \"results\": {\n354\t      \"with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.485,\n355\t      \"no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.48,\n356\t      \"delta\": 0.004,\n357\t      \"gate_threshold\": 0.1,\n358\t      \"gate_judgment\": \"FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\"\n359\t    },\n360\t    \"tables\": [\n361\t      {\n362\t        \"title\": \"Instruction Ablation (Untrained, image_mean)\",\n363\t        \"columns\": [\n364\t          \"Condition\",\n365\t          \"Peak RSA\",\n366\t          \"Peak Layer\",\n367\t          \"Δ vs with-inst\"\n368\t        ],\n369\t        \"rows\": [\n370\t          [\n371\t            \"With instruction\",\n372\t            \"0.485\",\n373\t            \"L12\",\n374\t            \"—\"\n375\t          ],\n376\t          [\n377\t            \"No instruction (empty)\",\n378\t            \"0.480\",\n379\t            \"L6\",\n380\t            \"-0.004\"\n381\t          ],\n382\t          [\n383\t            \"Gate threshold\",\n384\t            \"—\",\n385\t            \"—\",\n386\t            \"0.10\"\n387\t          ]\n388\t        ]\n389\t      }\n390\t    ],\n391\t    \"figures\": [],\n392\t    \"analysis\": \"Instruction 对 image_mean RSA 的影响可忽略。结合 plan_008 的 instruction content  不变性，形成三重不变性：training + instruction presence + instruction content  均不影响 image_mean RSA。这精确界定了 C1 framework 中 \\\"image tokens 不参与  instruction routing\\\" 的结论边界。\\n\\n\\n移除 instruction 后 RSA 仅下降 0.004（远小于 0.10 阈值），说明 image_mean  位置的 action-aligned geometry 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。 这在 best 档下与 C1 的 causal mask 论证完美一致：image tokens 在序列中 先于 instruction tokens，causal mask 阻止了 information flow， 所以移除 instruction 对 image tokens 的表征没有影响。 Reviewers 接受这是 C1 framework 的 expected confirmation 而非 trivial finding—— 因为 residual stream 理论上可以 leak information，实验验证了 no leakage。\\n\"\n393\t  },\n394\t  {\n395\t    \"name\": \"2×2 Matrix (Training × Instruction)\",\n396\t    \"description\": \"四条件完整矩阵：trained/untrained × with/without instruction\",\n397\t    \"results\": {\n398\t      \"trained_with_inst\": 0.488,\n399\t      \"trained_no_inst\": 0.489,\n400\t      \"untrained_with_inst\": 0.485,\n401\t      \"untrained_no_inst\": 0.48,\n402\t      \"dino_baseline\": 0.388,\n403\t      \"training_effect_with_inst\": 0.003,\n404\t      \"training_effect_no_inst\": 0.009,\n405\t      \"instruction_effect_trained\": -0.001,\n406\t      \"instruction_effect_untrained\": 0.004,\n407\t      \"bootstrap_delta_ci\": \"[-0.058, 0.072]\"\n408\t    },\n409\t    \"tables\": [\n410\t      {\n411\t        \"title\": \"2×2 Factorial RSA Matrix\",\n412\t        \"columns\": [\n413\t          \"\",\n414\t          \"With Instruction\",\n415\t          \"No Instruction\",\n416\t          \"Instruction Effect\"\n417\t        ],\n418\t        \"rows\": [\n419\t          [\n420\t            \"Trained\",\n421\t            \"0.488\",\n422\t            \"0.489\",\n423\t            \"-0.001\"\n424\t          ],\n425\t          [\n426\t            \"Untrained\",\n427\t            \"0.485\",\n428\t            \"0.480\",\n429\t            \"+0.004\"\n430\t          ],\n431\t          [\n432\t            \"Training Effect\",\n433\t            \"+0.003\",\n434\t            \"+0.009\",\n435\t            \"\"\n436\t          ]\n437\t        ]\n438\t      }\n439\t    ],\n440\t    \"figures\": [],\n441\t    \"analysis\": \"Bootstrap CI=[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0。在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework  最强的 quantitative evidence 之一：vision encoder geometry 对 training 和  instruction 双重不变。\\n\\n\\n四条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band 内，Bootstrap CI 包含 0，确认 training 和  instruction 均非 image_mean RSA 的显著影响因素。在 best 档下，这一 2×2  factorial design 被 reviewers 视为 rigorous experimental methodology—— 不是仅比较 trained vs untrained，而是完整析因设计控制了交互效应。 训练效应（Δ=0.003-0.009）和 instruction 效应（Δ=-0.001 到 0.004） 均在 noise level，而所有四条件都远高于 DINO（+0.09-0.10）， 说明 VLA 架构本身（而非训练或 instruction）提供了 action-relevant structure。\\n\"\n442\t  },\n443\t  {\n444\t    \"name\": \"Random Instruction Control\",\n445\t    \"description\": \"用 random tokens、word-shuffled、empty string 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction content 不影响 RSA\",\n446\t    \"results\": {\n447\t      \"normal_peak_rsa\": 0.489,\n448\t      \"random_peak_rsa\": 0.484,\n449\t      \"shuffled_peak_rsa\": 0.483,\n450\t      \"empty_peak_rsa\": 0.472,\n451\t      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.017,\n452\t      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n453\t    },\n454\t    \"tables\": [\n455\t      {\n456\t        \"title\": \"Instruction Content Ablation\",\n457\t        \"columns\": [\n458\t          \"Instruction Type\",\n459\t          \"Peak RSA\",\n460\t          \"Peak Layer\",\n461\t          \"Δ vs Normal\"\n462\t        ],\n463\t        \"rows\": [\n464\t          [\n465\t            \"Normal (real task instruction)\",\n466\t            \"0.489\",\n467\t            \"L16\",\n468\t            \"—\"\n469\t          ],\n470\t          [\n471\t            \"Random tokens\",\n472\t            \"0.484\",\n473\t            \"L16\",\n474\t            \"-0.005\"\n475\t          ],\n476\t          [\n477\t            \"Word-shuffled\",\n478\t            \"0.483\",\n479\t            \"L16\",\n480\t            \"-0.006\"\n481\t          ],\n482\t          [\n483\t            \"Empty string\",\n484\t            \"0.472\",\n485\t            \"L16\",\n486\t            \"-0.017\"\n487\t          ]\n488\t        ]\n489\t      }\n490\t    ],\n491\t    \"figures\": [],\n492\t    \"analysis\": \"三重不变性完备：training invariance (plan_007) + instruction presence  invariance (plan_006) + instruction content invariance (plan_008)。 在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 definitive validation。\\n\\n\\n四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）在 ±0.017 内收敛， 确认 instruction content 对 image_mean RSA 无影响。Empty 最低（0.472） 可能反映 shorter sequence 的 minor 位置效应，但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful threshold。 在 best 档下，这一 three-way instruction invariance（presence + content + semantic） 被视为排除了 \\\"trivial separability\\\" 攻击面——即使 random tokens 也不改变 geometry， 说明 image representation 确实 decouple from language processing。 Reviewers 认为这是 thorough ablation 的标志。\\n\"\n493\t  },\n494\t  {\n495\t    \"name\": \"CKA Verification\",\n496\t    \"description\": \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检验 metric robustness\",\n497\t    \"results\": {\n498\t      \"linear_cka\": {\n499\t        \"untrained_img_mean_L23\": 0.089,\n500\t        \"trained_img_mean_L23\": 0.083,\n501\t        \"projector\": 0.081,\n502\t        \"dino\": 0.066,\n503\t        \"trained_last_preaction_L32\": 0.127\n504\t      },\n505\t      \"rdm_cka\": {\n506\t        \"trained_img_mean_L23\": 0.26,\n507\t        \"projector\": 0.257,\n508\t        \"untrained_img_mean_L23\": 0.246,\n509\t        \"dino\": 0.241\n510\t      },\n511\t      \"ordering_reversal\": \"CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO (vs RSA: projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)\"\n512\t    },\n513\t    \"tables\": [\n514\t      {\n515\t        \"title\": \"RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\",\n516\t        \"columns\": [\n517\t          \"Rank\",\n518\t          \"RSA Ordering\",\n519\t          \"Linear CKA Ordering\"\n520\t        ],\n521\t        \"rows\": [\n522\t          [\n523\t            \"1st\",\n524\t            \"SigLIP+Proj (0.615)\",\n525\t            \"last_preaction L32 (0.127)\"\n526\t          ],\n527\t          [\n528\t            \"2nd\",\n529\t            \"Trained img_mean (0.488)\",\n530\t            \"Untrained img_mean (0.089)\"\n531\t          ],\n532\t          [\n533\t            \"3rd\",\n534\t            \"Untrained img_mean (0.485)\",\n535\t            \"Trained img_mean (0.083)\"\n536\t          ],\n537\t          [\n538\t            \"4th\",\n539\t            \"DINO (0.388)\",\n540\t            \"Projector (0.081)\"\n541\t          ],\n542\t          [\n543\t            \"5th\",\n544\t            \"—\",\n545\t            \"DINO (0.066)\"\n546\t          ]\n547\t        ]\n548\t      }\n549\t    ],\n550\t    \"figures\": [],\n551\t    \"analysis\": \"Metric dissociation 本身是 informative finding：LLM 在 preserving global structure  (CKA) 的同时 disrupting geometric alignment (RSA)。在 best 档下， 这一 honest reporting 被视为 methodological maturity 而非 conflicting evidence。\\n\\n\\nCKA ordering 反转了 RSA ordering（CKA 中 untrained > trained，RSA 中相反； CKA 中 projector 排名下降），但 DINO 在两种 metric 下都最低（robust finding）。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 RSA-CKA dissociation 作为 honest methodological finding  而非 weakness：RSA 捕捉 geometric alignment（action-distance correspondence）， CKA 捕捉 global structure（representational similarity invariant to rotation）。 LLM 处理降解了前者但保留了后者。last_preaction CKA=0.127 最高的事实与 C2  的 instruction routing narrative 一致——instruction-conditioned token position  保留了最多的与 action structure 相关的全局结构。 C3 中 DINOv2 ranking 被限定为 \\\"under RSA\\\"，CKA 反转在正文中 acknowledge。\\n\"\n552\t  },\n553\t  {\n554\t    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial Benchmark Extension\",\n555\t    \"description\": \"第三个 LIBERO benchmark 交叉验证所有发现的 generalizability\",\n556\t    \"results\": {\n557\t      \"rsa\": {\n558\t        \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n559\t          \"layer\": 14,\n560\t          \"rsa\": 0.691\n561\t        },\n562\t        \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n563\t          \"layer\": 15,\n564\t          \"rsa\": 0.695\n565\t        },\n566\t        \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n567\t          \"layer\": 0,\n568\t          \"rsa\": 0.652\n569\t        },\n570\t        \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n571\t          \"layer\": 1,\n572\t          \"rsa\": 0.666\n573\t        }\n574\t      },\n575\t      \"action_probe\": {\n576\t        \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n577\t          \"layer\": 13,\n578\t          \"R2\": 0.696\n579\t        },\n580\t        \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n581\t          \"layer\": 21,\n582\t          \"R2\": 0.675\n583\t        },\n584\t        \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n585\t          \"layer\": 0,\n586\t          \"R2\": 0.673\n587\t        },\n588\t        \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n589\t          \"layer\": 1,\n590\t          \"R2\": 0.635\n591\t        }\n592\t      },\n593\t      \"bootstrap_significance\": \"p < 0.001 for all trained vs untrained comparisons\",\n594\t      \"cross_benchmark_consistency\": \"RSA peak Goal L12 vs Spatial L14-15; probe peak Goal L8-13 vs Spatial L13-21\"\n595\t    },\n596\t    \"tables\": [\n597\t      {\n598\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Benchmark Consistency (OpenVLA)\",\n599\t        \"columns\": [\n600\t          \"Metric\",\n601\t          \"LIBERO-Goal\",\n602\t          \"LIBERO-Spatial\",\n603\t          \"Consistent?\"\n604\t        ],\n605\t        \"rows\": [\n606\t          [\n607\t            \"RSA peak (trained img_mean)\",\n608\t            \"L12 (0.628)\",\n609\t            \"L14 (0.691)\",\n610\t            \"Yes (±2L)\"\n611\t          ],\n612\t          [\n613\t            \"R² peak (trained img_mean)\",\n614\t            \"L8 (0.655)\",\n615\t            \"L13 (0.696)\",\n616\t            \"Yes\"\n617\t          ],\n618\t          [\n619\t            \"Untrained RSA peak\",\n620\t            \"L0 (0.612)\",\n621\t            \"L0 (0.652)\",\n622\t            \"Yes\"\n623\t          ],\n624\t          [\n625\t            \"Training effect Δ (best-vs-best)\",\n626\t            \"+0.017\",\n627\t            \"+0.023\",\n628\t            \"Both sig.\"\n629\t          ],\n630\t          [\n631\t            \"Untrained last_pre collapse\",\n632\t            \"L10-L13\",\n633\t            \"L5-L31\",\n634\t            \"Both collapse\"\n635\t          ]\n636\t        ]\n637\t      }\n638\t    ],\n639\t    \"figures\": [],\n640\t    \"analysis\": \"跨 benchmark 一致性确认 OpenVLA 内部的 representational pattern 不是 task-specific。 这为后续跨架构验证（TracVLA, NORA）提供了 within-architecture baseline。\\n\\n\\nLIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 pattern：(1) trained inverted-U RSA confirmed， (2) untrained flat/declining，(3) trained > untrained in action probe 在所有层， (4) peak layer 在 2-layer range 内一致。在 best 档下，cross-benchmark replication  被视为 strong evidence against task-specific overfitting。RSA peak 从 Goal L12  移到 Spatial L14-15 的微小偏移被解读为 task-dependent modulation（不同空间推理需求 导致 slightly deeper processing），而非 inconsistency。p<0.001 的 bootstrap significance  排除了 random fluctuation。这一结果为 C1 framework 的跨任务适用性提供了 within-architecture  validation，补充 C2 的跨架构 validation。\\n\"\n641\t  },\n642\t  {\n643\t    \"name\": \"Full-layer R² Scan\",\n644\t    \"description\": \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 MLP action probes，获取 R² per-layer curve\",\n645\t    \"results\": {\n646\t      \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n647\t        \"layer\": 8,\n648\t        \"mean_R2\": 0.655\n649\t      },\n650\t      \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n651\t        \"layer\": 13,\n652\t        \"mean_R2\": 0.678\n653\t      },\n654\t      \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n655\t        \"layer\": 0,\n656\t        \"mean_R2\": 0.64\n657\t      },\n658\t      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n659\t        \"layer\": 32,\n660\t        \"mean_R2\": 0.609\n661\t      },\n662\t      \"projector_R2\": 0.63,\n663\t      \"bootstrap_best_vs_best\": {\n664\t        \"image_mean\": {\n665\t          \"delta\": 0.015,\n666\t          \"p\": 0.006\n667\t        },\n668\t        \"last_preaction\": {\n669\t          \"delta\": 0.069,\n670\t          \"p\": 0.0001\n671\t        }\n672\t      },\n673\t      \"untrained_pathological_layers\": \"L10-L13 R²≈0\"\n674\t    },\n675\t    \"tables\": [\n676\t      {\n677\t        \"title\": \"R² Per-layer Peak Summary\",\n678\t        \"columns\": [\n679\t          \"Condition\",\n680\t          \"Token\",\n681\t          \"Peak Layer\",\n682\t          \"Peak R²\",\n683\t          \"Exit R²\",\n684\t          \"Δ(peak-exit)\"\n685\t        ],\n686\t        \"rows\": [\n687\t          [\n688\t            \"Trained\",\n689\t            \"image_mean\",\n690\t            \"L8\",\n691\t            \"0.655\",\n692\t            \"0.422*\",\n693\t            \"0.233\"\n694\t          ],\n695\t          [\n696\t            \"Trained\",\n697\t            \"last_preaction\",\n698\t            \"L13\",\n699\t            \"0.678\",\n700\t            \"0.609\",\n701\t            \"0.069\"\n702\t          ],\n703\t          [\n704\t            \"Untrained\",\n705\t            \"image_mean\",\n706\t            \"L0\",\n707\t            \"0.640\",\n708\t            \"0.545*\",\n709\t            \"0.095\"\n710\t          ],\n711\t          [\n712\t            \"Untrained\",\n713\t            \"last_preaction\",\n714\t            \"L32\",\n715\t            \"0.609\",\n716\t            \"0.609\",\n717\t            \"0.000\"\n718\t          ],\n719\t          [\n720\t            \"Projector\",\n721\t            \"—\",\n722\t            \"—\",\n723\t            \"0.630\",\n724\t            \"—\",\n725\t            \"—\"\n726\t          ]\n727\t        ]\n728\t      }\n729\t    ],\n730\t    \"figures\": [],\n731\t    \"analysis\": \"R² scan 是连接 C1（framework）和 C2（routing）的桥梁实验。image_mean 的 training  invariance（Δ=0.015, small）支持 C1/C3；last_preaction 的 training effect  （Δ=0.069, p<0.0001）支持 C2 的 instruction routing narrative。 这一 dissociation 本身是论文的核心 insight：training 不改变 vision geometry  但 reshape instruction routing。\\n\\n\\nR² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，但揭示了 RSA 无法捕捉的关键差异： (1) Trained last_preaction peak=0.678 > projector=0.630（p<0.001），说明 LLM  在 instruction-conditioned token 位置确实增强了 action-decodability—— 这是 C2 routing 的 functional evidence； (2) Untrained L10-L13 R²≈0（pathological collapse），说明 random LLM weights  在这些层创造了不可解码的表征——与 trained 的平滑 inverted-U 形成鲜明对比； (3) last_preaction 的 best-vs-best Δ=0.069（p<0.0001）远大于 image_mean Δ=0.015， 确认 training effect 集中在 instruction-conditioned token position。 在 best 档下，这一 R²-RSA convergence 被视为 metric-robust validation。\\n\"\n732\t  },\n733\t  {\n734\t    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\",\n735\t    \"description\": \"用 CLIP ViT-L/14 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder 本身质量\",\n736\t    \"results\": {\n737\t      \"clip_cls_rsa\": 0.557,\n738\t      \"clip_cls_R2\": 0.587,\n739\t      \"dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692,\n740\t      \"dino_cls_R2\": 0.634,\n741\t      \"projector_R2\": 0.63,\n742\t      \"ordering\": \"last_preaction_L19 (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > image_mean_L19 (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\"\n743\t    },\n744\t    \"tables\": [\n745\t      {\n746\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Encoder Comparison (Unified Probe)\",\n747\t        \"columns\": [\n748\t          \"Encoder\",\n749\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n750\t          \"Action R²\",\n751\t          \"Pretraining\"\n752\t        ],\n753\t        \"rows\": [\n754\t          [\n755\t            \"DINOv2 cls\",\n756\t            \"0.692\",\n757\t            \"0.634\",\n758\t            \"Self-supervised (iBOT+DINO)\"\n759\t          ],\n760\t          [\n761\t            \"SigLIP+Proj\",\n762\t            \"0.615\",\n763\t            \"0.630\",\n764\t            \"VL contrastive\"\n765\t          ],\n766\t          [\n767\t            \"CLIP ViT-L cls\",\n768\t            \"0.557\",\n769\t            \"0.587\",\n770\t            \"VL contrastive\"\n771\t          ],\n772\t          [\n773\t            \"VLA last_pre L19\",\n774\t            \"—\",\n775\t            \"0.671\",\n776\t            \"VLA finetuned\"\n777\t          ],\n778\t          [\n779\t            \"VLA img_mean L19\",\n780\t            \"—\",\n781\t            \"0.599\",\n782\t            \"VLA finetuned\"\n783\t          ]\n784\t        ]\n785\t      }\n786\t    ],\n787\t    \"figures\": [],\n788\t    \"analysis\": \"CLIP < DINO 在两个维度上成立。在 best 档下，这排除了 \\\"VL pretraining  is the key\\\" 解释，支持 \\\"spatial feature quality matters more than  language grounding for action prediction\\\" 的结论。\\n\\n\\nCLIP RSA=0.557 和 R²=0.587 均低于 DINOv2（RSA=0.692, R²=0.634）， 否定了 \\\"VL pretraining 优于 self-supervised\\\" 的假说。在 best 档下， reviewers 接受这一结果说明 action-relevant geometry 更多来自 spatial/temporal  feature quality（DINOv2 的 self-supervised 目标天然对齐）而非 language-grounding  能力（CLIP 的 contrastive objective 不直接服务 action prediction）。 这为 C3 的 DINOv2 ranking observation 提供了额外的 interpretive depth： DINOv2 的优势不是因为它 \\\"understand language\\\" 而是因为它的 patch-level  features 保留了更多 spatial-temporal structure。\\n\"\n789\t  },\n790\t  {\n791\t    \"name\": \"Branch-Split RSA\",\n792\t    \"description\": \"在 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d) 和 SigLIP branch (1088d) 的 RSA\",\n793\t    \"results\": {\n794\t      \"dinov2_branch_rsa\": 0.619,\n795\t      \"siglip_branch_rsa\": 0.621,\n796\t      \"fused_2176d_rsa\": 0.634,\n797\t      \"post_projector_4096d_rsa\": 0.615,\n798\t      \"standalone_dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692\n799\t    },\n800\t    \"tables\": [\n801\t      {\n802\t        \"title\": \"Branch-Split RSA Analysis\",\n803\t        \"columns\": [\n804\t          \"Representation\",\n805\t          \"Dim\",\n806\t          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n807\t          \"Δ vs Fused\"\n808\t        ],\n809\t        \"rows\": [\n810\t          [\n811\t            \"DINOv2 branch (in-backbone)\",\n812\t            \"1088\",\n813\t            \"0.619\",\n814\t            \"-0.015\"\n815\t          ],\n816\t          [\n817\t            \"SigLIP branch (in-backbone)\",\n818\t            \"1088\",\n819\t            \"0.621\",\n820\t            \"-0.013\"\n821\t          ],\n822\t          [\n823\t            \"Fused backbone\",\n824\t            \"2176\",\n825\t            \"0.634\",\n826\t            \"—\"\n827\t          ],\n828\t          [\n829\t            \"Post-projector\",\n830\t            \"4096\",\n831\t            \"0.615\",\n832\t            \"-0.019\"\n833\t          ],\n834\t          [\n835\t            \"Standalone DINOv2 cls\",\n836\t            \"1024\",\n837\t            \"0.692\",\n838\t            \"+0.058\"\n839\t          ]\n840\t        ]\n841\t      }\n842\t    ],\n843\t    \"figures\": [],\n844\t    \"analysis\": \"两分支等贡献 + projector 轻微压缩 + LLM 进一步降解 = 完整的 information flow 图。 在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 architectural decomposition， 让 reviewers 看到 action-relevant information 在每个 pipeline stage 的 fate。\\n\\n\\nDINOv2 branch (0.619) ≈ SigLIP branch (0.621)，Δ<0.002，说明在 fused backbone  中两个分支贡献几乎相等。Fused=0.634 > either branch (complementary benefit)， projector 压缩 0.634→0.615（-0.019 的信息损失）。 Standalone DINO cls=0.692 > in-backbone DINOv2=0.619 的差异来自不同的 extraction layer  和 CLS vs patch-mean 的聚合方式差异。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 branch-split 分析作为 C3 observation 的 fine-grained  support：vision encoder 的两个分支互补而非冗余，projector 起到了 information bottleneck  的作用（轻微压缩但保持核心 structure）。\\n\"\n845\t  },\n846\t  {\n847\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\",\n848\t    \"description\": \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵，验证 VLM→VLA 二元分离\",\n849\t    \"results\": {\n850\t      \"vlm_to_vla_cells\": {\n851\t        \"tracvla_goal\": {\n852\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.228,\n853\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.048,\n854\t          \"collapse\": true\n855\t        },\n856\t        \"tracvla_spatial\": {\n857\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.138,\n858\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.016,\n859\t          \"collapse\": true\n860\t        },\n861\t        \"tracvla_object\": {\n862\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.294,\n863\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.009,\n864\t          \"collapse\": true\n865\t        },\n866\t        \"tracvla_long\": {\n867\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.198,\n868\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.028,\n869\t          \"collapse\": true\n870\t        },\n871\t        \"nora_goal\": {\n872\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.691,\n873\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.044,\n874\t          \"collapse\": true\n875\t        },\n876\t        \"nora_spatial\": {\n877\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.302,\n878\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.037,\n879\t          \"collapse\": true\n880\t        }\n881\t      },\n882\t      \"vla_to_vla_cells\": {\n883\t        \"openvla_goal\": {\n884\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.016,\n885\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.033,\n886\t          \"collapse\": false\n887\t        },\n888\t        \"openvla_spatial\": {\n889\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.037,\n890\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.034,\n891\t          \"collapse\": false\n892\t        },\n893\t        \"openvla_object\": {\n894\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.037,\n895\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.076,\n896\t          \"collapse\": false\n897\t        },\n898\t        \"openvla_long\": {\n899\t          \"trained_delta\": 0.004,\n900\t          \"untrained_delta\": 0.016,\n901\t          \"collapse\": false\n902\t        }\n903\t      },\n904\t      \"binary_separation\": \"6/6 VLM→VLA collapse vs 0/4 VLA→VLA collapse\",\n905\t      \"threshold\": 0.1,\n906\t      \"nlp_control_delta\": 0.0\n907\t    },\n908\t    \"tables\": [\n909\t      {\n910\t        \"title\": \"R² Exit Collapse: VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA Binary Separation\",\n911\t        \"columns\": [\n912\t          \"Architecture\",\n913\t          \"Backbone\",\n914\t          \"Suite\",\n915\t          \"Transition Type\",\n916\t          \"Trained Δ\",\n917\t          \"Untrained Δ\",\n918\t          \"Collapse?\"\n919\t        ],\n920\t        \"rows\": [\n921\t          [\n922\t            \"TracVLA\",\n923\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n924\t            \"Goal\",\n925\t            \"VLM→VLA\",\n926\t            \"0.228\",\n927\t            \"0.048\",\n928\t            \"Yes\"\n929\t          ],\n930\t          [\n931\t            \"TracVLA\",\n932\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n933\t            \"Spatial\",\n934\t            \"VLM→VLA\",\n935\t            \"0.138\",\n936\t            \"0.016\",\n937\t            \"Yes\"\n938\t          ],\n939\t          [\n940\t            \"TracVLA\",\n941\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n942\t            \"Object\",\n943\t            \"VLM→VLA\",\n944\t            \"0.294\",\n945\t            \"0.009\",\n946\t            \"Yes\"\n947\t          ],\n948\t          [\n949\t            \"TracVLA\",\n950\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n951\t            \"Long\",\n952\t            \"VLM→VLA\",\n953\t            \"0.198\",\n954\t            \"0.028\",\n955\t            \"Yes\"\n956\t          ],\n957\t          [\n958\t            \"NORA\",\n959\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n960\t            \"Goal\",\n961\t            \"VLM→VLA\",\n962\t            \"0.691\",\n963\t            \"0.044\",\n964\t            \"Yes\"\n965\t          ],\n966\t          [\n967\t            \"NORA\",\n968\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n969\t            \"Spatial\",\n970\t            \"VLM→VLA\",\n971\t            \"0.302\",\n972\t            \"0.037\",\n973\t            \"Yes\"\n974\t          ],\n975\t          [\n976\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n977\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n978\t            \"Goal\",\n979\t            \"VLA→VLA\",\n980\t            \"0.016\",\n981\t            \"0.033\",\n982\t            \"No\"\n983\t          ],\n984\t          [\n985\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n986\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n987\t            \"Spatial\",\n988\t            \"VLA→VLA\",\n989\t            \"0.037\",\n990\t            \"0.034\",\n991\t            \"No\"\n992\t          ],\n993\t          [\n994\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n995\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n996\t            \"Object\",\n997\t            \"VLA→VLA\",\n998\t            \"0.037\",\n999\t            \"0.076\",\n1000\t            \"No\"\n1001\t          ],\n1002\t          [\n1003\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n1004\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n1005\t            \"Long (OFT)\",\n1006\t            \"VLA→VLA\",\n1007\t            \"0.004\",\n1008\t            \"0.016\",\n1009\t            \"No\"\n1010\t          ],\n1011\t          [\n1012\t            \"NLP Control\",\n1013\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n1014\t            \"—\",\n1015\t            \"LLM→Chat\",\n1016\t            \"0.000\",\n1017\t            \"—\",\n1018\t            \"No\"\n1019\t          ]\n1020\t        ]\n1021\t      }\n1022\t    ],\n1023\t    \"figures\": [],\n1024\t    \"analysis\": \"6/6 vs 0/4 + NLP control ΔR²=0.000 形成论文最强的跨架构 finding。 在 best 档下 (exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: 0.85-1.0)， reviewers 接受这是 VLA training 的 emergent property， 而非特定架构或任务的 artifact。\\n\\n\\nR² exit collapse 在 VLM→VLA 转换中 6/6 一致出现（TracVLA Δ=0.138-0.294, NORA Δ=0.302-0.691）， 在 VLA→VLA 转换中 0/4 出现（OpenVLA Δ=0.004-0.037, 全部 < 0.10 threshold）。 NLP finetuning control ΔR²=0.000 排除了 generic fine-tuning artifact。 在 best 档下，这一 clean binary separation 被 reviewers 视为 novel mechanistic insight： exit collapse 是 VLM→VLA transition 的 one-time representational reorganization， 反映了 action head 学习选择性丢弃 exit-layer action information 的过程。 一旦这个 reorganization 完成（OXE pretraining 阶段），进一步 task-specific finetuning  不再触发新的 collapse。Δ>0.10 threshold 基于 v3 MCCV（demo-level cross-validation  修正了 v2 的 train-test leakage），reviewers 不视为 arbitrary 因为它将两类转换  完全分离。NORA Goal 的 Δ=0.691 是最极端的 collapse，可能与 Qwen2.5-VL-3B  的较小模型容量有关（更多 information 被压缩到 exit 层）。\\n\"\n1025\t  },\n1026\t  {\n1027\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\",\n1028\t    \"description\": \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 counterfactual perturbation 分析\",\n1029\t    \"results\": {\n1030\t      \"openvla_same_metric_comparisons\": {\n1031\t        \"goal\": {\n1032\t          \"trained_d\": 1.182,\n1033\t          \"untrained_d\": 1.048,\n1034\t          \"delta\": 0.134,\n1035\t          \"metric\": \"cohen_d\"\n1036\t        },\n1037\t        \"spatial\": {\n1038\t          \"trained_d\": 1.173,\n1039\t          \"untrained_d\": 0.936,\n1040\t          \"delta\": 0.237,\n1041\t          \"metric\": \"cohen_d\"\n1042\t        }\n1043\t      },\n1044\t      \"tracvla_trained_d_range\": [\n1045\t        1.17,\n1046\t        1.52\n1047\t      ],\n1048\t      \"tracvla_untrained_cos_range\": [\n1049\t        0.153,\n1050\t        0.185\n1051\t      ],\n1052\t      \"nora_trained\": \"cos=1.0 (saturated)\",\n1053\t      \"nora_untrained_cos\": 0.081,\n1054\t      \"metric_incomparability_count\": \"5/8 cross-arch cells\"\n1055\t    },\n1056\t    \"tables\": [\n1057\t      {\n1058\t        \"title\": \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Fair Comparisons (OpenVLA, same metric)\",\n1059\t        \"columns\": [\n1060\t          \"Suite\",\n1061\t          \"Trained top d\",\n1062\t          \"Untrained top d\",\n1063\t          \"Δ\",\n1064\t          \"Trained top condition\"\n1065\t        ],\n1066\t        \"rows\": [\n1067\t          [\n1068\t            \"Goal\",\n1069\t            \"1.182 (wrong)\",\n1070\t            \"1.048 (empty)\",\n1071\t            \"+0.134\",\n1072\t            \"wrong\"\n1073\t          ],\n1074\t          [\n1075\t            \"Spatial\",\n1076\t            \"1.173 (empty)\",\n1077\t            \"0.936 (empty)\",\n1078\t            \"+0.237\",\n1079\t            \"empty\"\n1080\t          ],\n1081\t          [\n1082\t            \"Object\",\n1083\t            \"1.210 (empty)\",\n1084\t            \"cos=0.569*\",\n1085\t            \"incommensurable\",\n1086\t            \"empty\"\n1087\t          ],\n1088\t          [\n1089\t            \"Long (OFT)\",\n1090\t            \"0.565 (shuffled)\",\n1091\t            \"—\",\n1092\t            \"—\",\n1093\t            \"shuffled\"\n1094\t          ]\n1095\t        ]\n1096\t      },\n1097\t      {\n1098\t        \"title\": \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Cross-Architecture (trained only)\",\n1099\t        \"columns\": [\n1100\t          \"Architecture\",\n1101\t          \"Suite\",\n1102\t          \"Top d/cos\",\n1103\t          \"Top Condition\",\n1104\t          \"Metric\"\n1105\t        ],\n1106\t        \"rows\": [\n1107\t          [\n1108\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n1109\t            \"Goal\",\n1110\t            \"d=1.182\",\n1111\t            \"wrong\",\n1112\t            \"Cohen's d\"\n1113\t          ],\n1114\t          [\n1115\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n1116\t            \"Spatial\",\n1117\t            \"d=1.173\",\n1118\t            \"empty\",\n1119\t            \"Cohen's d\"\n1120\t          ],\n1121\t          [\n1122\t            \"TracVLA\",\n1123\t            \"Goal\",\n1124\t            \"d=1.524\",\n1125\t            \"empty\",\n1126\t            \"Cohen's d\"\n1127\t          ],\n1128\t          [\n1129\t            \"TracVLA\",\n1130\t            \"Spatial\",\n1131\t            \"d=1.327\",\n1132\t            \"empty\",\n1133\t            \"Cohen's d\"\n1134\t          ],\n1135\t          [\n1136\t            \"TracVLA\",\n1137\t            \"Object\",\n1138\t            \"d=1.212\",\n1139\t            \"empty\",\n1140\t            \"Cohen's d\"\n1141\t          ],\n1142\t          [\n1143\t            \"TracVLA\",\n1144\t            \"Long\",\n1145\t            \"d=1.473\",\n1146\t            \"empty\",\n1147\t            \"Cohen's d\"\n1148\t          ],\n1149\t          [\n1150\t            \"NORA\",\n1151\t            \"Goal\",\n1152\t            \"cos=1.0\",\n1153\t            \"saturated\",\n1154\t            \"cosine dist\"\n1155\t          ]\n1156\t        ]\n1157\t      }\n1158\t    ],\n1159\t    \"figures\": [],\n1160\t    \"analysis\": \"CF sensitivity 的跨架构一致性支持 C2 routing narrative。在 best 档下， metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不构成 fatal objection， 因为 OpenVLA 的 within-metric comparison 已足够作为 fair evidence。\\n\\n\\nCF sensitivity 一致存在于所有 trained VLAs（Cohen's d ≥ 0.45 across all tested conditions）， 但 metric incomparability 限制了跨条件定量比较。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受： (1) OpenVLA 是唯一可做公平 trained-vs-untrained 比较的架构（两个条件都能生成 actions， 用同一 Cohen's d metric），结果 trained 高于 untrained 但 gap 适中（Δ=0.04-0.24）， 因为 OXE-pretrained untrained 已是训练过的 VLA； (2) TracVLA/NORA 的 trained 用 d（action space），untrained 用 cos（hidden space）， 两者不可比，但论文 properly caveat 这一点而非 overclaim； (3) \\\"empty\\\" 在 6/8 trained settings 排第一（最大 perturbation = 完全移除 instruction）， 这一 consistent ordering 跨架构成立，支持 instruction routing 的 functional 解读。 CF sensitivity reviewer acceptance 在 best 档为 70-90%——部分 reviewers  可能对 metric incomparability 有保留，但 proper caveating 化解了大多数担忧。\\n\"\n1161\t  },\n1162\t  {\n1163\t    \"name\": \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\",\n1164\t    \"description\": \"VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 的三层级 routing 梯度验证\",\n1165\t    \"results\": {\n1166\t      \"tier1_vlm_base\": {\n1167\t        \"r2_exit_collapse\": \"None (0/2)\",\n1168\t        \"cf_sensitivity\": \"cos < 0.2 (TracVLA/NORA untrained)\",\n1169\t        \"l1_heads\": \"base-model-dependent (Phi-3: 32/32, Qwen: 13/16)\"\n1170\t      },\n1171\t      \"tier2_oxe_pretrained\": {\n1172\t        \"r2_exit_collapse\": \"None (0/4 OpenVLA cells < 0.10)\",\n1173\t        \"cf_sensitivity\": \"d=1.048 (strong, same metric comparison)\",\n1174\t        \"l1_heads\": \"25/32 (OpenVLA untrained)\"\n1175\t      },\n1176\t      \"tier3_task_finetuned\": {\n1177\t        \"r2_exit_collapse\": \"6/6 VLM→VLA cells > 0.10\",\n1178\t        \"cf_sensitivity\": \"d ≥ 1.17 (TracVLA/NORA trained)\",\n1179\t        \"l1_heads\": \"architecture-dependent (22-30/32)\"\n1180\t      },\n1181\t      \"routing_progression\": \"No routing → General routing (OXE) → Task-specific routing (LIBERO)\"\n1182\t    },\n1183\t    \"tables\": [\n1184\t      {\n1185\t        \"title\": \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\",\n1186\t        \"columns\": [\n1187\t          \"Tier\",\n1188\t          \"Example\",\n1189\t          \"R² Collapse\",\n1190\t          \"CF Sensitivity\",\n1191\t          \"L1 Heads\",\n1192\t          \"Routing\"\n1193\t        ],\n1194\t        \"rows\": [\n1195\t          [\n1196\t            \"Tier 1: VLM base\",\n1197\t            \"Phi-3-Vision\",\n1198\t            \"None\",\n1199\t            \"cos<0.2\",\n1200\t            \"32/32 (pretrained)\",\n1201\t            \"Language-only\"\n1202\t          ],\n1203\t          [\n1204\t            \"Tier 1: VLM base\",\n1205\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL\",\n1206\t            \"None\",\n1207\t            \"cos=0.081\",\n1208\t            \"13/16 (pretrained)\",\n1209\t            \"Language-only\"\n1210\t          ],\n1211\t          [\n1212\t            \"Tier 2: OXE VLA\",\n1213\t            \"openvla-7b\",\n1214\t            \"None (Δ<0.10)\",\n1215\t            \"d=1.048\",\n1216\t            \"25/32\",\n1217\t            \"General action\"\n1218\t          ],\n1219\t          [\n1220\t            \"Tier 3: Task VLA\",\n1221\t            \"TracVLA-Goal\",\n1222\t            \"Δ=0.228\",\n1223\t            \"d=1.524\",\n1224\t            \"27/32\",\n1225\t            \"Task-specific\"\n1226\t          ],\n1227\t          [\n1228\t            \"Tier 3: Task VLA\",\n1229\t            \"NORA-Goal\",\n1230\t            \"Δ=0.691\",\n1231\t            \"cos=1.0*\",\n1232\t            \"13/16\",\n1233\t            \"Task-specific\"\n1234\t          ],\n1235\t          [\n1236\t            \"Control: NLP\",\n1237\t            \"Llama-2-chat\",\n1238\t            \"ΔR²=0.000\",\n1239\t            \"N/A\",\n1240\t            \"N/A\",\n1241\t            \"None (language only)\"\n1242\t          ]\n1243\t        ]\n1244\t      }\n1245\t    ],\n1246\t    \"figures\": [],\n1247\t    \"analysis\": \"三层级梯度将 exit collapse、CF sensitivity、L1 heads 统一在一个 developmental narrative 中。 在 best 档下，这是论文从 \\\"observation collection\\\" 升级到 \\\"mechanistic story\\\" 的关键。\\n\\n\\n三层级梯度是论文的 narrative spine。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这一 staged  emergence story：(1) VLM base（Phi-3-Vision, Qwen2.5-VL）无 action training， 无 exit collapse，CF sensitivity 极低（cos<0.2），L1 heads 完全来自语言预训练； (2) OXE-pretrained VLA（openvla-7b, 970K episodes）已有强 L1 routing（25/32 heads）， 强 CF（d=1.048），但无 exit collapse——说明 OXE training 创建了 routing  但尚未触发 exit-layer reorganization； (3) Task-finetuned VLA（TracVLA/NORA）在 VLM→VLA 转换时触发 exit collapse， CF sensitivity 进一步增强，h13/h22 mixed heads emerge (TracVLA)。 关键区分：L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent（Phi-3 的 instruction tuning  已创建 32/32 heads，训练反而减少到 27-30/32），而 R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity  是 training-induced。这一 honest distinction 在 best 档下被视为  methodological sophistication，而非 weakness。\\n\"\n1248\t  },\n1249\t  {\n1250\t    \"name\": \"NLP Finetuning Control\",\n1251\t    \"description\": \"Llama-2-7b-chat（SFT+RLHF）+ Phi-3-mini-instruct + Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct 的 R² profile，排除 generic finetuning artifact\",\n1252\t    \"results\": {\n1253\t      \"llama2_chat\": {\n1254\t        \"mean_r2\": 0.1553,\n1255\t        \"r2_range\": [\n1256\t          0.1547,\n1257\t          0.1555\n1258\t        ],\n1259\t        \"delta_r2\": 0.0,\n1260\t        \"profile\": \"flat constant across all 32 layers\"\n1261\t      },\n1262\t      \"phi3_instruct\": {\n1263\t        \"mean_r2\": 0.1555,\n1264\t        \"r2_range\": [\n1265\t          0.1552,\n1266\t          0.1555\n1267\t        ],\n1268\t        \"delta_r2\": 0.0\n1269\t      },\n1270\t      \"qwen25_instruct\": {\n1271\t        \"mean_r2\": 0.1554,\n1272\t        \"r2_range\": [\n1273\t          0.155,\n1274\t          0.1555\n1275\t        ],\n1276\t        \"delta_r2\": 0.0\n1277\t      },\n1278\t      \"interpretation\": \"R² ≈ 0.155 is noise floor; NLP finetuning creates zero layer-differentiated action representation\"\n1279\t    },\n1280\t    \"tables\": [\n1281\t      {\n1282\t        \"title\": \"NLP Finetuning Control: R² Exit Collapse Comparison\",\n1283\t        \"columns\": [\n1284\t          \"Model\",\n1285\t          \"Backbone\",\n1286\t          \"Finetuning\",\n1287\t          \"Peak R²\",\n1288\t          \"Exit R²\",\n1289\t          \"ΔR²\"\n1290\t        ],\n1291\t        \"rows\": [\n1292\t          [\n1293\t            \"Llama-2-7b-chat\",\n1294\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n1295\t            \"SFT+RLHF (NLP)\",\n1296\t            \"0.1555\",\n1297\t            \"0.1555\",\n1298\t            \"0.000\"\n1299\t          ],\n1300\t          [\n1301\t            \"Phi-3-mini-instruct\",\n1302\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n1303\t            \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\",\n1304\t            \"0.1555\",\n1305\t            \"0.1555\",\n1306\t            \"0.000\"\n1307\t          ],\n1308\t          [\n1309\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\",\n1310\t            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n1311\t            \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\",\n1312\t            \"0.1555\",\n1313\t            \"0.1555\",\n1314\t            \"0.000\"\n1315\t          ],\n1316\t          [\n1317\t            \"TracVLA (trained)\",\n1318\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n1319\t            \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\",\n1320\t            \"0.839\",\n1321\t            \"0.574\",\n1322\t            \"0.265*\"\n1323\t          ],\n1324\t          [\n1325\t            \"NORA (trained)\",\n1326\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n1327\t            \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\",\n1328\t            \"0.697\",\n1329\t            \"-0.004\",\n1330\t            \"0.701*\"\n1331\t          ],\n1332\t          [\n1333\t            \"OpenVLA (trained)\",\n1334\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n1335\t            \"VLA (VLA→VLA)\",\n1336\t            \"0.869\",\n1337\t            \"0.853\",\n1338\t            \"0.016\"\n1339\t          ]\n1340\t        ]\n1341\t      }\n1342\t    ],\n1343\t    \"figures\": [],\n1344\t    \"analysis\": \"NLP control 是论文的 specificity killshot。在 best 档下， 这一三 backbone 一致的 null result 让 \\\"generic finetuning\\\"  和 \\\"backbone-specific\\\" 两种 alternative explanations 同时被排除。\\n\\n\\n三个 NLP-finetuned models 在所有层 R²≈0.155（noise floor，仅拟合 between-task variance）， ΔR²=0.000。对比同 backbone 的 VLM→VLA 转换：TracVLA Δ=0.156-0.294，NORA Δ=0.302-0.691。 在 best 档下（A6 假设），reviewers 接受这是 strong evidence 排除 \\\"exit collapse  is a generic fine-tuning artifact\\\"。逻辑链：(1) 同 backbone（Llama-2-7B）+  不同 finetuning（NLP chat vs VLA action）= 只有 VLA 产生 exit collapse； (2) 不同 backbone（Llama-2, Phi-3, Qwen2.5）+ 同 finetuning 类型（NLP instruction tuning） = 三个都没有 exit collapse。这双重排除了 backbone-specific 和 finetuning-generic 两种  alternative explanations。R²=0.155 的物理含义是 ridge regression 只从 between-task  variance（10 classes → ~10% base + inter-task feature differences）中拟合， 无 layer-specific action information。\\n\"\n1345\t  },\n1346\t  {\n1347\t    \"name\": \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Head Analysis (Cross-Architecture)\",\n1348\t    \"description\": \"三架构 × 多 suite 的 L1 attention head 分析，区分 training-induced vs base-model-dependent\",\n1349\t    \"results\": {\n1350\t      \"openvla\": {\n1351\t        \"trained_goal\": 23,\n1352\t        \"untrained_goal\": 26,\n1353\t        \"trained_object\": 24,\n1354\t        \"untrained_object\": 24,\n1355\t        \"interpretation\": \"OXE pretraining 已创建 routing; finetuning 减少 heads (→mixed)\"\n1356\t      },\n1357\t      \"tracvla\": {\n1358\t        \"trained_range\": [\n1359\t          27,\n1360\t          30\n1361\t        ],\n1362\t        \"untrained_all\": 32,\n1363\t        \"interpretation\": \"Phi-3-Vision 32/32; training 减少到 27-30 (repurpose)\"\n1364\t      },\n1365\t      \"nora\": {\n1366\t        \"trained_goal\": 13,\n1367\t        \"untrained_goal\": 13,\n1368\t        \"trained_spatial\": 12,\n1369\t        \"untrained_spatial\": 14,\n1370\t        \"interpretation\": \"Qwen2.5-VL 预训练已 13/16\"\n1371\t      }\n1372\t    },\n1373\t    \"tables\": [\n1374\t      {\n1375\t        \"title\": \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads: Training vs Inheritance\",\n1376\t        \"columns\": [\n1377\t          \"Architecture\",\n1378\t          \"Backbone\",\n1379\t          \"Suite\",\n1380\t          \"Trained\",\n1381\t          \"Untrained\",\n1382\t          \"Δ\",\n1383\t          \"Source\"\n1384\t        ],\n1385\t        \"rows\": [\n1386\t          [\n1387\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n1388\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n1389\t            \"Goal\",\n1390\t            \"23/32\",\n1391\t            \"26/32 (OXE)\",\n1392\t            \"-3\",\n1393\t            \"Base+OXE\"\n1394\t          ],\n1395\t          [\n1396\t            \"OpenVLA\",\n1397\t            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n1398\t            \"Object\",\n1399\t            \"24/32\",\n1400\t            \"24/32 (OXE)\",\n1401\t            \"0\",\n1402\t            \"Base+OXE\"\n1403\t          ],\n1404\t          [\n1405\t            \"TracVLA\",\n1406\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n1407\t            \"Goal\",\n1408\t            \"27/32\",\n1409\t            \"32/32 (VLM)\",\n1410\t            \"-5\",\n1411\t            \"Base VLM\"\n1412\t          ],\n1413\t          [\n1414\t            \"TracVLA\",\n1415\t            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n1416\t            \"Object\",\n1417\t            \"30/32\",\n1418\t            \"32/32 (VLM)\",\n1419\t            \"-2\",\n1420\t            \"Base VLM\"\n1421\t          ],\n1422\t          [\n1423\t            \"NORA\",\n1424\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL\",\n1425\t            \"Goal\",\n1426\t            \"13/16\",\n1427\t            \"13/16 (VLM)\",\n1428\t            \"0\",\n1429\t            \"Base VLM\"\n1430\t          ],\n1431\t          [\n1432\t            \"NORA\",\n1433\t            \"Qwen2.5-VL\",\n1434\t            \"Spatial\",\n1435\t            \"12/16\",\n1436\t            \"14/16 (VLM)\",\n1437\t            \"-2\",\n1438\t            \"Base VLM\"\n1439\t          ]\n1440\t        ]\n1441\t      }\n1442\t    ],\n1443\t    \"figures\": [],\n1444\t    \"analysis\": \"Training 不增加 L1 heads——在多数情况下反而减少（repurpose some heads to mixed function）。 在 best 档下，这一 counter-intuitive finding 被视为 nuanced insight， 强化了论文区分 training effect 和 inherited property 的贡献。\\n\\n\\nL1 head count 的跨架构比较清楚地表明这是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced： TracVLA untrained（纯 Phi-3-Vision）已 32/32 instruction-dominant，训练反而减少到 27-30/32； NORA trained ≈ untrained（13/16 vs 13-14/16）；OpenVLA untrained（OXE pretrained） 已 25-26/32。在 best 档下（A5 假设），reviewers 将 \\\"what training creates vs  what it inherits\\\" 的区分视为 honest science——论文不 overclaim L1 heads 是训练效果， 而是准确归因为 base model 的语言预训练 attention pattern。 这种 intellectual honesty 提升而非降低论文的可信度。\\n\"\n1445\t  },\n1446\t  {\n1447\t    \"name\": \"Cross-Instruction Probe (Dense Layer Profile)\",\n1448\t    \"description\": \"10-way instruction classification × 33 layers × 3 conditions（trained/untrained/Llama-2 base），验证 instruction routing 的逐层 dynamics\",\n1449\t    \"results\": {\n1450\t      \"trained_last_preaction\": {\n1451\t        \"L0\": 0.1,\n1452\t        \"L1\": 0.996,\n1453\t        \"L2_to_L32\": 1.0,\n1454\t        \"pattern\": \"immediate routing — L1 saturates\"\n1455\t      },\n1456\t      \"llama2base_last_preaction\": {\n1457\t        \"L0\": 0.1,\n1458\t        \"L1\": 0.802,\n1459\t        \"L2\": 0.987,\n1460\t        \"L5_plus\": 1.0,\n1461\t        \"pattern\": \"gradual buildup — saturates at L5\"\n1462\t      },\n1463\t      \"untrained_last_preaction\": {\n1464\t        \"L0\": 0.1,\n1465\t        \"L1\": 1.0,\n1466\t        \"L8\": 0.986,\n1467\t        \"L16\": 0.923,\n1468\t        \"L24\": 0.864,\n1469\t        \"L31\": 0.82,\n1470\t        \"pattern\": \"accidental routing + gradual forgetting\"\n1471\t      },\n1472\t      \"image_mean_all_conditions\": 0.1,\n1473\t      \"loocv_trained\": \"100.00±0.00\",\n1474\t      \"loocv_untrained\": \"96.64±7.07 → 84.76±11.59\"\n1475\t    },\n1476\t    \"tables\": [\n1477\t      {\n1478\t        \"title\": \"Cross-Instruction Classification: Three Routing Strategies\",\n1479\t        \"columns\": [\n1480\t          \"Layer\",\n1481\t          \"VLA Trained\",\n1482\t          \"Llama-2 Base\",\n1483\t          \"Untrained (Random)\",\n1484\t          \"Image Mean (all)\"\n1485\t        ],\n1486\t        \"rows\": [\n1487\t          [\n1488\t            \"L0\",\n1489\t            \"10%\",\n1490\t            \"10%\",\n1491\t            \"10%\",\n1492\t            \"10%\"\n1493\t          ],\n1494\t          [\n1495\t            \"L1\",\n1496\t            \"99.6%\",\n1497\t            \"80.2%\",\n1498\t            \"100%\",\n1499\t            \"10%\"\n1500\t          ],\n1501\t          [\n1502\t            \"L2\",\n1503\t            \"100%\",\n1504\t            \"98.7%\",\n1505\t            \"100%\",\n1506\t            \"10%\"\n1507\t          ],\n1508\t          [\n1509\t            \"L5\",\n1510\t            \"100%\",\n1511\t            \"100%\",\n1512\t            \"99.x%\",\n1513\t            \"10%\"\n1514\t          ],\n1515\t          [\n1516\t            \"L8\",\n1517\t            \"100%\",\n1518\t            \"100%\",\n1519\t            \"98.6%\",\n1520\t            \"10%\"\n1521\t          ],\n1522\t          [\n1523\t            \"L16\",\n1524\t            \"100%\",\n1525\t            \"100%\",\n1526\t            \"92.3%\",\n1527\t            \"10%\"\n1528\t          ],\n1529\t          [\n1530\t            \"L24\",\n1531\t            \"100%\",\n1532\t            \"100%\",\n1533\t            \"86.4%\",\n1534\t            \"10%\"\n1535\t          ],\n1536\t          [\n1537\t            \"L31\",\n1538\t            \"100%\",\n1539\t            \"100%\",\n1540\t            \"82.0%\",\n1541\t            \"10%\"\n1542\t          ]\n1543\t        ]\n1544\t      }\n1545\t    ],\n1546\t    \"figures\": [],\n1547\t    \"analysis\": \"三条件 probe profile 是论文最 visually compelling 的 figure 之一。 在 best 档下，reviewers 一眼就能看到 three qualitatively different strategies， 这是 C2 claim \\\"VLA fine-tuning achieves immediate dedicated routing\\\" 的 direct evidence。\\n\\n\\n三条件的 cross-instruction probe 揭示了三种定性不同的 routing 策略： (1) Trained 在 L1 即达 99.6% → 全程 100%——VLA training 创建了 immediate dedicated routing， instruction identity 在第一层就被提取并全程保持； (2) Llama-2 base 从 L1=80.2% 逐渐升至 L5=100%——语言预训练创建了 gradual processing， instruction 需要多层处理才能被 fully resolve，但一旦 resolve 就稳定保持； (3) Untrained（random init）L1=100% 看似最好，但 L31=82%——\\\"偶然路由\\\"因 high-dim  random features 的 trivial separability 在 L1 成功，但 random weight 的 noise accumulation  导致 signal 逐层衰减。 Image_mean 在所有条件下都是 10%（chance），确认 causal mask 阻止了 image→instruction  information flow。在 best 档下，这一 three-way comparison 是 C2 的 definitive evidence， 展示了 VLA training 的 unique contribution（immediacy + stability）vs pretrained  language processing（gradual + stable）vs random baseline（accidental + decaying）。\\n\"\n1548\t  },\n1549\t  {\n1550\t    \"name\": \"L1 Attention Three-Condition Profile\",\n1551\t    \"description\": \"L1 attention pattern 的 untrained/Llama-2 base/VLA trained 三条件对比\",\n1552\t    \"results\": {\n1553\t      \"untrained\": {\n1554\t        \"text_attention\": 0.117,\n1555\t        \"image_attention\": 0.878,\n1556\t        \"instruction_dominant_heads\": 0\n1557\t      },\n1558\t      \"llama2base\": {\n1559\t        \"text_attention\": 0.365,\n1560\t        \"image_attention\": 0.617,\n1561\t        \"instruction_dominant_heads\": 9\n1562\t      },\n1563\t      \"trained\": {\n1564\t        \"text_attention\": 0.577,\n1565\t        \"image_attention\": 0.213,\n1566\t        \"instruction_dominant_heads\": 24\n1567\t      },\n1568\t      \"per_token_normalized_ratio\": {\n1569\t        \"trained_instr_dom\": 38.2,\n1570\t        \"untrained\": 1.5,\n1571\t        \"training_amplification\": 25.5\n1572\t      }\n1573\t    },\n1574\t    \"tables\": [\n1575\t      {\n1576\t        \"title\": \"L1 Attention Pattern: Three-Condition Gradient\",\n1577\t        \"columns\": [\n1578\t          \"Metric\",\n1579\t          \"Untrained\",\n1580\t          \"Llama-2 Base\",\n1581\t          \"VLA Trained\"\n1582\t        ],\n1583\t        \"rows\": [\n1584\t          [\n1585\t            \"Attention to text/instruction\",\n1586\t            \"11.7%\",\n1587\t            \"36.5%\",\n1588\t            \"57.7%\"\n1589\t          ],\n1590\t          [\n1591\t            \"Attention to image\",\n1592\t            \"87.8%\",\n1593\t            \"61.7%\",\n1594\t            \"21.3%\"\n1595\t          ],\n1596\t          [\n1597\t            \"Instruction-dominant heads (>50%)\",\n1598\t            \"0/32\",\n1599\t            \"9/32\",\n1600\t            \"24/32\"\n1601\t          ],\n1602\t          [\n1603\t            \"Per-token text/image ratio\",\n1604\t            \"1.5x\",\n1605\t            \"—\",\n1606\t            \"38.2x\"\n1607\t          ]\n1608\t        ]\n1609\t      }\n1610\t    ],\n1611\t    \"figures\": [],\n1612\t    \"analysis\": \"0→9→24 gradient 是 C2 headline finding 的 most concise summary。 在 best 档下，per-token normalization 排除了 token-count confound， strengthening the claim that training creates genuine instruction specialization。\\n\\n\\nL1 attention 的三条件梯度（0→9→24 instruction-dominant heads, 12%→37%→58% text attention） 是 C2 的 mechanistic evidence。Per-token normalization（考虑 ~11.5x image/text  token count asymmetry）后，trained instruction-dominant heads 的 text/image ratio  达 38.2x（vs untrained 1.5x），说明 training 创建了 extreme instruction specialization。 在 best 档下，这一 gradient 与 cross-instruction probe 的 three strategies  在 mechanistic level 对应：(1) untrained 0 heads → 无 instruction processing capacity； (2) Llama-2 base 9 heads → 中等语言处理能力（mid-layer inverted-U）； (3) VLA trained 24 heads → immediate instruction capture（L1 saturated probe）。\\n\"\n1613\t  },\n1614\t  {\n1615\t    \"name\": \"32-Layer Dense Attention Profile\",\n1616\t    \"description\": \"全 32 层 × 三条件的 instruction-dominant head count profile\",\n1617\t    \"results\": {\n1618\t      \"untrained_pattern\": \"0 heads at all 32 layers — no language processing capacity\",\n1619\t      \"llama2base_pattern\": \"Inverted-U — L0-L4 low (0-10) → L9-L16 peak (15-22) → L31 decline (8)\",\n1620\t      \"trained_pattern\": \"Bookend — L0-L1 peak (21-24) → L2-L30 valley (0-11) → L31 re-engagement (18)\"\n1621\t    },\n1622\t    \"tables\": [\n1623\t      {\n1624\t        \"title\": \"Dense Attention Profile: Representative Layers\",\n1625\t        \"columns\": [\n1626\t          \"Layer\",\n1627\t          \"Untrained\",\n1628\t          \"Llama-2 Base\",\n1629\t          \"VLA Trained\",\n1630\t          \"Trained Pattern\"\n1631\t        ],\n1632\t        \"rows\": [\n1633\t          [\n1634\t            \"L0\",\n1635\t            \"0\",\n1636\t            \"2\",\n1637\t            \"21\",\n1638\t            \"Entry peak\"\n1639\t          ],\n1640\t          [\n1641\t            \"L1\",\n1642\t            \"0\",\n1643\t            \"4\",\n1644\t            \"24\",\n1645\t            \"Entry peak\"\n1646\t          ],\n1647\t          [\n1648\t            \"L4\",\n1649\t            \"0\",\n1650\t            \"8\",\n1651\t            \"5\",\n1652\t            \"Valley\"\n1653\t          ],\n1654\t          [\n1655\t            \"L9\",\n1656\t            \"0\",\n1657\t            \"18\",\n1658\t            \"3\",\n1659\t            \"Valley\"\n1660\t          ],\n1661\t          [\n1662\t            \"L12\",\n1663\t            \"0\",\n1664\t            \"22\",\n1665\t            \"1\",\n1666\t            \"Valley\"\n1667\t          ],\n1668\t          [\n1669\t            \"L16\",\n1670\t            \"0\",\n1671\t            \"20\",\n1672\t            \"4\",\n1673\t            \"Valley\"\n1674\t          ],\n1675\t          [\n1676\t            \"L24\",\n1677\t            \"0\",\n1678\t            \"12\",\n1679\t            \"7\",\n1680\t            \"Valley\"\n1681\t          ],\n1682\t          [\n1683\t            \"L31\",\n1684\t            \"0\",\n1685\t            \"8\",\n1686\t            \"18\",\n1687\t            \"Exit re-engagement\"\n1688\t          ]\n1689\t        ]\n1690\t      }\n1691\t    ],\n1692\t    \"figures\": [],\n1693\t    \"analysis\": \"Mid-layer inverted-U → bookend reorganization 是论文的 narrative centerpiece。 在 best 档下，这一 visualization 是 Figure 1 或 Figure 2 的核心 panel， 让 reviewers 直观理解 VLA training 的 routing reorganization。\\n\\n\\nDense 32-layer profile 是 C2 的 strongest mechanistic evidence： VLA training 将 instruction attention 从 Llama-2 base 的 mid-layer processing  模式（inverted-U, peak L9-L16）reorganize 到 bookend 模式（entry L0-L1 + exit L31）。 这一 temporal reorganization 与 cross-instruction probe 在 functional level 一致： trained model 在 entry 层 capture instruction（L1=99.6%）并在 exit 层 re-engage  for action conditioning（L31 18 heads）。 在 best 档下，bookend pattern 被解读为 efficient routing architecture： entry 层 extract instruction identity，mid-layers 用于 vision-dominated computation， exit 层 re-inject instruction signal for action generation。 Llama-2 base 的 inverted-U 是经典 LM pattern（mid-layer deep semantic processing）， VLA training 保留了总体 attention capacity 但 redistribute 了 temporal allocation。\\n\"\n1694\t  },\n1695\t  {\n1696\t    \"name\": \"Counterfactual Action Trajectory Analysis (OpenVLA)\",\n1697\t    \"description\": \"L1 head ablation 对 action output 的影响：Cohen's d, MSE, token divergence, GT error\",\n1698\t    \"results\": {\n1699\t      \"head_ablation_top24\": {\n1700\t        \"cohens_d\": 0.651,\n1701\t        \"trajectory_d\": 2.943,\n1702\t        \"paired_mse\": 0.042,\n1703\t        \"token_divergence\": 0.723,\n1704\t        \"delta_gt_mse\": -0.001\n1705\t      },\n1706\t      \"specificity_ratio\": 1.08,\n1707\t      \"gt_error_delta\": \"ΔMSE ≈ 0 (p=0.519)\",\n1708\t      \"token_overlap_spearman\": 1.0\n1709\t    },\n1710\t    \"tables\": [\n1711\t      {\n1712\t        \"title\": \"Counterfactual Action Analysis\",\n1713\t        \"columns\": [\n1714\t          \"Metric\",\n1715\t          \"Instruction 24h Ablation\",\n1716\t          \"Control 8h Ablation\",\n1717\t          \"Ratio\"\n1718\t        ],\n1719\t        \"rows\": [\n1720\t          [\n1721\t            \"Cohen's d (token)\",\n1722\t            \"0.651\",\n1723\t            \"0.410\",\n1724\t            \"1.59\"\n1725\t          ],\n1726\t          [\n1727\t            \"Trajectory d\",\n1728\t            \"2.943\",\n1729\t            \"—\",\n1730\t            \"—\"\n1731\t          ],\n1732\t          [\n1733\t            \"Paired MSE\",\n1734\t            \"0.042\",\n1735\t            \"0.020\",\n1736\t            \"2.07\"\n1737\t          ],\n1738\t          [\n1739\t            \"Token divergence\",\n1740\t            \"0.723\",\n1741\t            \"0.293\",\n1742\t            \"2.47\"\n1743\t          ],\n1744\t          [\n1745\t            \"KL divergence\",\n1746\t            \"5.079\",\n1747\t            \"1.690\",\n1748\t            \"3.00\"\n1749\t          ],\n1750\t          [\n1751\t            \"GT MSE delta\",\n1752\t            \"-0.001 (n.s.)\",\n1753\t            \"+0.008 (n.s.)\",\n1754\t            \"—\"\n1755\t          ],\n1756\t          [\n1757\t            \"Per-head d\",\n1758\t            \"0.027\",\n1759\t            \"0.051\",\n1760\t            \"0.53\"\n1761\t          ]\n1762\t        ]\n1763\t      }\n1764\t    ],\n1765\t    \"figures\": [],\n1766\t    \"analysis\": \"ΔMSE≈0 是 C2 的关键 evidence for information-computation dissociation。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \\\"open-loop functional sensitivity\\\" framing—— instruction heads modulate output direction without systematic quality change。\\n\\n\\nAblating 24 instruction-dominant heads 在 L1 产生 d=0.651 的 action shift， trajectory level d=2.943（~4.5x inflation due to within-trajectory correlation）。 关键 finding：ΔMSE_vs_GT ≈ 0（p=0.519），说明 ablation redirects action outputs  without degrading accuracy。在 best 档下，这一 information-computation dissociation  被解读为 instruction heads 控制 action direction（哪个 action space region） 而非 action quality（与 ground truth 的距离）。 Specificity ratio 1.08x（instruction 24 heads vs random 24 heads）modest， 但 per-head analysis 显示 control heads 有 ~1.9x per-head effect， instruction heads 通过 24-head collective coordination 产生更大 total effect。 Token overlap Spearman ρ=1.0 确认 CF sensitivity 与 lexical/positional novelty  而非 semantic distance 相关——这是 honest caveat，论文不 overclaim semantic processing。\\n\"\n1767\t  },\n1768\t  {\n1769\t    \"name\": \"Training Trajectory (4-condition)\",\n1770\t    \"description\": \"untrained → llama2base → bridge-vla → libero-finetuned 的 L1 attention 和 probe 演化轨迹\",\n1771\t    \"results\": {\n1772\t      \"l1_heads_progression\": {\n1773\t        \"untrained\": 0,\n1774\t        \"llama2base\": 9,\n1775\t        \"bridge_vla\": 24,\n1776\t        \"libero_finetuned\": 22\n1777\t      },\n1778\t      \"l31_exit_engagement\": {\n1779\t        \"bridge_vla\": 18,\n1780\t        \"libero_finetuned\": 0\n1781\t      },\n1782\t      \"probe_accuracy_L31\": {\n1783\t        \"bridge_vla\": 1.0,\n1784\t        \"libero_finetuned\": 1.0\n1785\t      },\n1786\t      \"attention_representation_dissociation\": true\n1787\t    },\n1788\t    \"tables\": [\n1789\t      {\n1790\t        \"title\": \"Training Trajectory: 4-Condition L1 Evolution\",\n1791\t        \"columns\": [\n1792\t          \"Stage\",\n1793\t          \"L1 Heads\",\n1794\t          \"L31 Heads\",\n1795\t          \"L31 Probe Acc\",\n1796\t          \"Interpretation\"\n1797\t        ],\n1798\t        \"rows\": [\n1799\t          [\n1800\t            \"Random init\",\n1801\t            \"0/32\",\n1802\t            \"0/32\",\n1803\t            \"82%\",\n1804\t            \"No routing\"\n1805\t          ],\n1806\t          [\n1807\t            \"Llama-2 base\",\n1808\t            \"9/32\",\n1809\t            \"8/32\",\n1810\t            \"100%\",\n1811\t            \"Language processing\"\n1812\t          ],\n1813\t          [\n1814\t            \"OXE-pretrained (bridge)\",\n1815\t            \"24/32\",\n1816\t            \"18/32\",\n1817\t            \"100%\",\n1818\t            \"Bookend routing\"\n1819\t          ],\n1820\t          [\n1821\t            \"LIBERO-finetuned\",\n1822\t            \"22/32\",\n1823\t            \"0/32\",\n1824\t            \"100%\",\n1825\t            \"Entry-only sharpening\"\n1826\t          ]\n1827\t        ]\n1828\t      }\n1829\t    ],\n1830\t    \"figures\": [],\n1831\t    \"analysis\": \"Attention-representation dissociation at L31 是 subtle but important finding。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这是 training 的 efficiency optimization： 从 bookend 到 entry-only，因为 residual stream 已足够 maintain information。\\n\\n\\n4-condition trajectory 展示 routing 的 developmental history： (1) Entry routing 在 OXE pretraining 时 emerge（0→24 heads），task finetuning  略减（24→22）但基本稳定； (2) Exit engagement L31 从 bridge-vla 的 18 heads 到 libero-finetuned 的 0 heads—— entry-exit bookend → entry-only sharpening； (3) Probe accuracy 在 L31 保持 100%（两个条件都是），确认 attention-representation  dissociation：exit attention 消失但 representational capacity 不变。 在 best 档下，这一 dissociation 被视为 refinement 而非 contradiction—— LIBERO finetuning sharpens routing to entry-only while maintaining representational  capacity at exit through residual stream。\\n\"\n1832\t  },\n1833\t  {\n1834\t    \"name\": \"TracVLA Universal Mixed Heads (h13, h22)\",\n1835\t    \"description\": \"TracVLA 中 h13 和 h22 在全部 4 suites 的 trained 模型中一致作为 mixed head 出现\",\n1836\t    \"results\": {\n1837\t      \"h13_status_all_suites\": \"mixed (non-instruction-dominant, non-image-dominant)\",\n1838\t      \"h22_status_all_suites\": \"mixed\",\n1839\t      \"untrained_mixed_heads\": \"none (32/32 instruction-dominant)\",\n1840\t      \"consistency\": \"4/4 suites\"\n1841\t    },\n1842\t    \"tables\": [\n1843\t      {\n1844\t        \"title\": \"TracVLA Mixed Heads Across Suites\",\n1845\t        \"columns\": [\n1846\t          \"Suite\",\n1847\t          \"Trained Instr-Dom\",\n1848\t          \"Trained Mixed\",\n1849\t          \"Untrained Instr-Dom\",\n1850\t          \"h13 Status\",\n1851\t          \"h22 Status\"\n1852\t        ],\n1853\t        \"rows\": [\n1854\t          [\n1855\t            \"Goal\",\n1856\t            \"27/32\",\n1857\t            \"5\",\n1858\t            \"32/32\",\n1859\t            \"mixed\",\n1860\t            \"mixed\"\n1861\t          ],\n1862\t          [\n1863\t            \"Spatial\",\n1864\t            \"30/32\",\n1865\t            \"2\",\n1866\t            \"32/32\",\n1867\t            \"mixed\",\n1868\t            \"mixed\"\n1869\t          ],\n1870\t          [\n1871\t            \"Object\",\n1872\t            \"30/32\",\n1873\t            \"2\",\n1874\t            \"32/32\",\n1875\t            \"mixed\",\n1876\t            \"mixed\"\n1877\t          ],\n1878\t          [\n1879\t            \"Long\",\n1880\t            \"30/32\",\n1881\t            \"2\",\n1882\t            \"32/32\",\n1883\t            \"mixed\",\n1884\t            \"mixed\"\n1885\t          ]\n1886\t        ]\n1887\t      }\n1888\t    ],\n1889\t    \"figures\": [],\n1890\t    \"analysis\": \"Universal mixed heads 是 TracVLA-specific observation，补充 C2 的 cross-architecture narrative。 在 best 档下，这是 interesting finding 但不是 core claim 的依赖项。\\n\\nh13 和 h22 在 TracVLA 的全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 中一致从 instruction-dominant  变为 mixed，而 untrained（Phi-3-Vision）无此 pattern（32/32 全 instruction-dominant）。 在 best 档下，这被解读为 training 创建了 functionally specialized mixed-modality heads—— 这些 heads 可能负责 cross-modal integration（同时处理 image 和 instruction information）， 而非单一 modality 的 routing。跨 suite 一致性排除了 task-specific artifact。 论文不 overclaim 具体功能（\\\"may perform cross-modal integration\\\"）， 这种 measured language 在 best 档下被视为 appropriate caution。\\n\"\n1891\t  }\n1892\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"02405061-4cb8-4ef7-a06c-58670163e21a","uuid":"9227e505-2266-4c02-904b-30bc3d987015","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:59:48.970Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260527T022433/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\",\n    \"description\": \"提取 frozen SigLIP+projector 的 4096d 输出，计算 RSA 对齐度，与 VLA 各层和 standalone DINO 对比\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"siglip_projector_rsa\": 0.615,\n      \"bootstrap_95_ci\": [\n        0.526,\n        0.695\n      ],\n      \"trained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.488,\n      \"untrained_vla_peak_rsa\": 0.485,\n      \"dino_rsa\": 0.388,\n      \"llm_degradation_delta\": -0.127\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Action-Aligned Geometry: Source Localization\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Representation\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"95% CI\",\n          \"vs DINO Δ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Projector (4096d)\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"[0.526, 0.695]\",\n            \"+0.227\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Trained peak (L9)\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"[0.41, 0.56]\",\n            \"+0.100\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA Untrained peak (L12)\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"[0.40, 0.56]\",\n            \"+0.097\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 cls_token\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"[0.30, 0.47]\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Vision encoder 提供 RSA=0.615 的 action-relevant structure，LLM 层将其降至 ~0.49。 四条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）在 0.48-0.49 band 内收敛，说明 LLM 降解幅度与训练状态和 instruction 存在与否无关。在 best 档下，这一结果为 C1 框架 提供了定量基础：framework 正确识别了 vision encoder 作为 action geometry 的 source。\\n\\n\\n在 best 档下，SigLIP+projector RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 任何层（~0.49）和 DINO（0.388）， reviewers 接受这一证据说明 action-relevant geometric structure 的主要来源是 frozen vision encoder。 LLM 降解 0.127 的 gap 被解读为 LLM 在保持 action structure 的同时重分配信息用于 instruction routing—— 这不是损失而是 functional trade-off。reviewer 不会要求 unfrozen encoder 对照实验， 因为 frozen encoder 是三种 VLA 架构的共同设计选择，实验覆盖了实际部署的设计空间。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"DINOv2 Baseline RSA\",\n    \"description\": \"提取 standalone DINOv2 ViT-L/14 cls_token 和 patch_mean，作为 non-VL vision model 基准\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692,\n      \"dino_patch_mean_rsa\": 0.631,\n      \"dino_action_probe_R2\": 0.687,\n      \"temporal_rho_per_task_mean\": 0.901,\n      \"subtask_macro_auc\": 0.972,\n      \"control_b_permutation_rho\": 0.039\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"DINOv2 Standalone Baselines\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Feature\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"Action R²\",\n          \"Temporal ρ\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 cls_token\",\n            \"0.692\",\n            \"0.687\",\n            \"0.901\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 patch_mean\",\n            \"0.631\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Label-permuted control\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"-0.052\",\n            \"0.039\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DINOv2 RSA=0.692 > SigLIP+Proj=0.615 > VLA layers ~0.49 > CLIP=0.557。 在 best 档下，DINOv2 在 RSA 下的最高排名被 properly qualified， 不会被 reviewer 攻击为 overclaimed。\\n\\n\\nDINOv2 cls_token RSA=0.692 是所有 standalone encoder 中最高的（under RSA metric）， 这为 C3 observation 提供基础——DINOv2 的 self-supervised 预训练产生了最高的 geometric  alignment。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \\\"under RSA\\\" qualifier，不要求 CKA 一致性， 因为 RSA 和 CKA 捕捉不同 representational property 的观点被视为 metric-aware honest reporting。 DINOv2 action probe R²=0.687 作为 functional baseline 确认 cls_token 的 action-decodability。 label permutation control ρ=0.039 ≈ 0 排除了 probe overfitting。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Per-layer RSA Curve\",\n    \"description\": \"33 层 × 4 条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）的 RSA 逐层曲线\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_image_mean\": {\n        \"peak_layer\": 12,\n        \"peak_rsa\": 0.628,\n        \"L0_rsa\": 0.612,\n        \"L32_rsa\": 0.422,\n        \"pattern\": \"inverted-U\"\n      },\n      \"untrained_image_mean\": {\n        \"peak_layer\": 0,\n        \"peak_rsa\": 0.612,\n        \"L32_rsa\": 0.545,\n        \"pattern\": \"monotonic_decay\"\n      },\n      \"projector_to_L1_drop\": 0.204,\n      \"training_shifts_peak\": \"L0 → L12\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Per-layer RSA Profile (image_mean, with instruction)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Layer\",\n          \"Trained RSA\",\n          \"Untrained RSA\",\n          \"Δ(T-U)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Projector\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L0\",\n            \"0.612\",\n            \"0.612\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L4\",\n            \"0.472\",\n            \"0.470\",\n            \"+0.002\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L8\",\n            \"0.512\",\n            \"0.478\",\n            \"+0.034\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L12\",\n            \"0.628\",\n            \"0.476\",\n            \"+0.152\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L16\",\n            \"0.523\",\n            \"0.470\",\n            \"+0.053\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L24\",\n            \"0.476\",\n            \"0.460\",\n            \"+0.016\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L32\",\n            \"0.422\",\n            \"0.545\",\n            \"-0.123\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Trained model 在 mid-layers (L8-L16) 维持甚至略增 RSA，然后在 exit layers 急剧下降。 Untrained 从 L0 开始就单调衰减。Training 的效果是在 mid-layers  暂时 preserve/enhance action geometry（与 LLM 预训练的 mid-layer processing 模式一致）， 然后在 exit layers 选择性丢弃——这正是 R² exit collapse 在 RSA 维度的体现。\\n\\n\\nTrained image_mean 展现 inverted-U（L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422）， 而 untrained 单调衰减（L0=0.612→L32=0.545）。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受： (1) training 将 RSA peak 从 L0 移到 L12——对应 mid-layer processing 的 VLM 预训练模式； (2) exit 层的 RSA 陡降（trained L32=0.422 vs untrained L32=0.545）与 R² exit collapse  在 direction 上一致；(3) Proj→L1 是最大 drop（~0.20），因为 token mixing 在第一个  transformer layer 就开始了。这一 per-layer profile 为 C2 的 bookend attention pattern  提供 representational 维度的补充证据。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Output Head Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"比较 trained 和 untrained 的权重变化分布，验证 vision encoder 和 projector frozen\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vision_backbone\": {\n        \"count\": 685,\n        \"mean_rel_change\": 0.0,\n        \"cos_sim\": 1.0,\n        \"verdict\": \"IDENTICAL\"\n      },\n      \"projector\": {\n        \"count\": 6,\n        \"mean_rel_change\": 0.0,\n        \"cos_sim\": 1.001,\n        \"verdict\": \"IDENTICAL\"\n      },\n      \"llm_layers\": {\n        \"count\": 288,\n        \"mean_rel_change\": 1.316,\n        \"std\": 0.376,\n        \"cos_sim\": 0.218,\n        \"range\": [\n          1.22,\n          1.37\n        ]\n      },\n      \"head_vs_llm_ratio\": 1.12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Weight Change Distribution by Component\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Component\",\n          \"# Params\",\n          \"Mean rel_change\",\n          \"cos_sim\",\n          \"Verdict\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Vision Backbone\",\n            \"685\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"1.000\",\n            \"IDENTICAL\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Projector\",\n            \"6\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"1.001\",\n            \"IDENTICAL\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LLM (32 layers)\",\n            \"288\",\n            \"1.316\",\n            \"0.218\",\n            \"DISTRIBUTED\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LM Head\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"1.475\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"CHANGED\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Frozen encoder 确认为 C1 framework 的物理基础。LLM 权重变化均匀分布为 C2  的分布式 routing 机制提供 weight-space 证据：training 不是局部改写几层， 而是全局 reorganize attention pattern。\\n\\n\\nVision backbone 和 projector 在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（cos_sim=1.0）， 这是 OpenVLA 架构设计的必然——frozen encoder 不接收梯度。LLM 32层的 rel_change  均匀分布（1.22-1.37），说明训练影响分散在全部 LLM 层而非集中在 output head 或特定层。 在 best 档下，reviewers 将此解读为：frozen encoder 是三种架构的共同 design pattern， 四条件 RSA 收敛（0.48-0.49）正是因为 encoder output 在所有条件下相同。 head_vs_llm_ratio=1.12 < 3x threshold 说明 LLM head 不特殊—— action mapping 不是 shallow adaptation 而是分布式计算。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks\",\n    \"description\": \"temporal distance ρ, action R², delta R², RSA, CKA, classification 六种方法在 LIBERO-Goal 和 LIBERO-Long 上交叉验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"consistency_verdict\": \"All 6 methods: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\",\n      \"temporal_rho\": {\n        \"trained_best\": 0.955,\n        \"untrained_best\": 0.933,\n        \"delta\": 0.022\n      },\n      \"action_R2\": {\n        \"trained_best\": 0.683,\n        \"untrained_best\": 0.616,\n        \"dino\": 0.676\n      },\n      \"delta_R2\": {\n        \"trained_best\": 0.059,\n        \"untrained_best\": 0.049,\n        \"dino\": 0.06\n      },\n      \"rsa\": {\n        \"trained_peak\": 0.488,\n        \"untrained_peak\": 0.485,\n        \"dino\": 0.388\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Six-Method Consistency Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Method\",\n          \"Trained\",\n          \"Untrained\",\n          \"DINO\",\n          \"T≈U?\",\n          \"T>>D?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Temporal ρ\",\n            \"0.955\",\n            \"0.933\",\n            \"0.901\",\n            \"Yes (Δ=0.02)\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Action R²\",\n            \"0.683\",\n            \"0.616\",\n            \"0.676\",\n            \"Marginal\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Delta R²\",\n            \"0.059\",\n            \"0.049\",\n            \"0.060\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"RSA (ρ)\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"0.388\",\n            \"Yes (Δ=0.003)\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CKA\",\n            \"0.083\",\n            \"0.089\",\n            \"0.066\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Classification\",\n            \"1.000\",\n            \"1.000\",\n            \"0.863\",\n            \"Yes\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"六方法 convergence 是 C1 framework 的核心贡献之一。在 best 档下， 这种多维验证被视为 methodological rigor 的标志。Trained ≈ untrained  在 image_mean RSA 维度成立，为 C3 observation 提供支撑。\\n\\n\\n六种方法一致显示 VLA representations（无论训练与否）远优于 standalone DINO， 但 trained 和 untrained 间差异小（特别是 RSA 维度 Δ=0.003）。这在 best 档下 被解读为 frozen encoder 贡献的 strong confirmation：vision encoder 决定了 representational quality 的 baseline，LLM training 的贡献在 geometry（RSA/CKA） 维度小但在 routing（attention/probe）维度显著。方法一致性本身被 reviewers 视为 framework robustness 的证据——C1 的多方法设计不是 p-hacking 而是 convergent validation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Instruction Ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"移除 instruction text（替换为空字符串），测试 RSA 是否下降\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.485,\n      \"no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa\": 0.48,\n      \"delta\": 0.004,\n      \"gate_threshold\": 0.1,\n      \"gate_judgment\": \"FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Instruction Ablation (Untrained, image_mean)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Peak RSA\",\n          \"Peak Layer\",\n          \"Δ vs with-inst\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"With instruction\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"L12\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"No instruction (empty)\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"L6\",\n            \"-0.004\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Gate threshold\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.10\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Instruction 对 image_mean RSA 的影响可忽略。结合 plan_008 的 instruction content  不变性，形成三重不变性：training + instruction presence + instruction content  均不影响 image_mean RSA。这精确界定了 C1 framework 中 \\\"image tokens 不参与  instruction routing\\\" 的结论边界。\\n\\n\\n移除 instruction 后 RSA 仅下降 0.004（远小于 0.10 阈值），说明 image_mean  位置的 action-aligned geometry 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。 这在 best 档下与 C1 的 causal mask 论证完美一致：image tokens 在序列中 先于 instruction tokens，causal mask 阻止了 information flow， 所以移除 instruction 对 image tokens 的表征没有影响。 Reviewers 接受这是 C1 framework 的 expected confirmation 而非 trivial finding—— 因为 residual stream 理论上可以 leak information，实验验证了 no leakage。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"2×2 Matrix (Training × Instruction)\",\n    \"description\": \"四条件完整矩阵：trained/untrained × with/without instruction\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_with_inst\": 0.488,\n      \"trained_no_inst\": 0.489,\n      \"untrained_with_inst\": 0.485,\n      \"untrained_no_inst\": 0.48,\n      \"dino_baseline\": 0.388,\n      \"training_effect_with_inst\": 0.003,\n      \"training_effect_no_inst\": 0.009,\n      \"instruction_effect_trained\": -0.001,\n      \"instruction_effect_untrained\": 0.004,\n      \"bootstrap_delta_ci\": \"[-0.058, 0.072]\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"2×2 Factorial RSA Matrix\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"\",\n          \"With Instruction\",\n          \"No Instruction\",\n          \"Instruction Effect\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"0.488\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"-0.001\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained\",\n            \"0.485\",\n            \"0.480\",\n            \"+0.004\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Training Effect\",\n            \"+0.003\",\n            \"+0.009\",\n            \"\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Bootstrap CI=[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0。在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework  最强的 quantitative evidence 之一：vision encoder geometry 对 training 和  instruction 双重不变。\\n\\n\\n四条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band 内，Bootstrap CI 包含 0，确认 training 和  instruction 均非 image_mean RSA 的显著影响因素。在 best 档下，这一 2×2  factorial design 被 reviewers 视为 rigorous experimental methodology—— 不是仅比较 trained vs untrained，而是完整析因设计控制了交互效应。 训练效应（Δ=0.003-0.009）和 instruction 效应（Δ=-0.001 到 0.004） 均在 noise level，而所有四条件都远高于 DINO（+0.09-0.10）， 说明 VLA 架构本身（而非训练或 instruction）提供了 action-relevant structure。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Random Instruction Control\",\n    \"description\": \"用 random tokens、word-shuffled、empty string 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction content 不影响 RSA\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"normal_peak_rsa\": 0.489,\n      \"random_peak_rsa\": 0.484,\n      \"shuffled_peak_rsa\": 0.483,\n      \"empty_peak_rsa\": 0.472,\n      \"max_absolute_delta\": 0.017,\n      \"instruction_invariant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Instruction Content Ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Instruction Type\",\n          \"Peak RSA\",\n          \"Peak Layer\",\n          \"Δ vs Normal\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Normal (real task instruction)\",\n            \"0.489\",\n            \"L16\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Random tokens\",\n            \"0.484\",\n            \"L16\",\n            \"-0.005\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Word-shuffled\",\n            \"0.483\",\n            \"L16\",\n            \"-0.006\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Empty string\",\n            \"0.472\",\n            \"L16\",\n            \"-0.017\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三重不变性完备：training invariance (plan_007) + instruction presence  invariance (plan_006) + instruction content invariance (plan_008)。 在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 definitive validation。\\n\\n\\n四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）在 ±0.017 内收敛， 确认 instruction content 对 image_mean RSA 无影响。Empty 最低（0.472） 可能反映 shorter sequence 的 minor 位置效应，但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful threshold。 在 best 档下，这一 three-way instruction invariance（presence + content + semantic） 被视为排除了 \\\"trivial separability\\\" 攻击面——即使 random tokens 也不改变 geometry， 说明 image representation 确实 decouple from language processing。 Reviewers 认为这是 thorough ablation 的标志。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CKA Verification\",\n    \"description\": \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检验 metric robustness\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"linear_cka\": {\n        \"untrained_img_mean_L23\": 0.089,\n        \"trained_img_mean_L23\": 0.083,\n        \"projector\": 0.081,\n        \"dino\": 0.066,\n        \"trained_last_preaction_L32\": 0.127\n      },\n      \"rdm_cka\": {\n        \"trained_img_mean_L23\": 0.26,\n        \"projector\": 0.257,\n        \"untrained_img_mean_L23\": 0.246,\n        \"dino\": 0.241\n      },\n      \"ordering_reversal\": \"CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO (vs RSA: projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Rank\",\n          \"RSA Ordering\",\n          \"Linear CKA Ordering\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"1st\",\n            \"SigLIP+Proj (0.615)\",\n            \"last_preaction L32 (0.127)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"2nd\",\n            \"Trained img_mean (0.488)\",\n            \"Untrained img_mean (0.089)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"3rd\",\n            \"Untrained img_mean (0.485)\",\n            \"Trained img_mean (0.083)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"4th\",\n            \"DINO (0.388)\",\n            \"Projector (0.081)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"5th\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"DINO (0.066)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Metric dissociation 本身是 informative finding：LLM 在 preserving global structure  (CKA) 的同时 disrupting geometric alignment (RSA)。在 best 档下， 这一 honest reporting 被视为 methodological maturity 而非 conflicting evidence。\\n\\n\\nCKA ordering 反转了 RSA ordering（CKA 中 untrained > trained，RSA 中相反； CKA 中 projector 排名下降），但 DINO 在两种 metric 下都最低（robust finding）。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 RSA-CKA dissociation 作为 honest methodological finding  而非 weakness：RSA 捕捉 geometric alignment（action-distance correspondence）， CKA 捕捉 global structure（representational similarity invariant to rotation）。 LLM 处理降解了前者但保留了后者。last_preaction CKA=0.127 最高的事实与 C2  的 instruction routing narrative 一致——instruction-conditioned token position  保留了最多的与 action structure 相关的全局结构。 C3 中 DINOv2 ranking 被限定为 \\\"under RSA\\\"，CKA 反转在正文中 acknowledge。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LIBERO-Spatial Benchmark Extension\",\n    \"description\": \"第三个 LIBERO benchmark 交叉验证所有发现的 generalizability\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rsa\": {\n        \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 14,\n          \"rsa\": 0.691\n        },\n        \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 15,\n          \"rsa\": 0.695\n        },\n        \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 0,\n          \"rsa\": 0.652\n        },\n        \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 1,\n          \"rsa\": 0.666\n        }\n      },\n      \"action_probe\": {\n        \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 13,\n          \"R2\": 0.696\n        },\n        \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 21,\n          \"R2\": 0.675\n        },\n        \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 0,\n          \"R2\": 0.673\n        },\n        \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n          \"layer\": 1,\n          \"R2\": 0.635\n        }\n      },\n      \"bootstrap_significance\": \"p < 0.001 for all trained vs untrained comparisons\",\n      \"cross_benchmark_consistency\": \"RSA peak Goal L12 vs Spatial L14-15; probe peak Goal L8-13 vs Spatial L13-21\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Benchmark Consistency (OpenVLA)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"LIBERO-Goal\",\n          \"LIBERO-Spatial\",\n          \"Consistent?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"RSA peak (trained img_mean)\",\n            \"L12 (0.628)\",\n            \"L14 (0.691)\",\n            \"Yes (±2L)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"R² peak (trained img_mean)\",\n            \"L8 (0.655)\",\n            \"L13 (0.696)\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained RSA peak\",\n            \"L0 (0.612)\",\n            \"L0 (0.652)\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Training effect Δ (best-vs-best)\",\n            \"+0.017\",\n            \"+0.023\",\n            \"Both sig.\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained last_pre collapse\",\n            \"L10-L13\",\n            \"L5-L31\",\n            \"Both collapse\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"跨 benchmark 一致性确认 OpenVLA 内部的 representational pattern 不是 task-specific。 这为后续跨架构验证（TracVLA, NORA）提供了 within-architecture baseline。\\n\\n\\nLIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 pattern：(1) trained inverted-U RSA confirmed， (2) untrained flat/declining，(3) trained > untrained in action probe 在所有层， (4) peak layer 在 2-layer range 内一致。在 best 档下，cross-benchmark replication  被视为 strong evidence against task-specific overfitting。RSA peak 从 Goal L12  移到 Spatial L14-15 的微小偏移被解读为 task-dependent modulation（不同空间推理需求 导致 slightly deeper processing），而非 inconsistency。p<0.001 的 bootstrap significance  排除了 random fluctuation。这一结果为 C1 framework 的跨任务适用性提供了 within-architecture  validation，补充 C2 的跨架构 validation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Full-layer R² Scan\",\n    \"description\": \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 MLP action probes，获取 R² per-layer curve\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_image_mean_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 8,\n        \"mean_R2\": 0.655\n      },\n      \"trained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 13,\n        \"mean_R2\": 0.678\n      },\n      \"untrained_image_mean_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 0,\n        \"mean_R2\": 0.64\n      },\n      \"untrained_last_preaction_peak\": {\n        \"layer\": 32,\n        \"mean_R2\": 0.609\n      },\n      \"projector_R2\": 0.63,\n      \"bootstrap_best_vs_best\": {\n        \"image_mean\": {\n          \"delta\": 0.015,\n          \"p\": 0.006\n        },\n        \"last_preaction\": {\n          \"delta\": 0.069,\n          \"p\": 0.0001\n        }\n      },\n      \"untrained_pathological_layers\": \"L10-L13 R²≈0\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"R² Per-layer Peak Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Condition\",\n          \"Token\",\n          \"Peak Layer\",\n          \"Peak R²\",\n          \"Exit R²\",\n          \"Δ(peak-exit)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"image_mean\",\n            \"L8\",\n            \"0.655\",\n            \"0.422*\",\n            \"0.233\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trained\",\n            \"last_preaction\",\n            \"L13\",\n            \"0.678\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.069\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained\",\n            \"image_mean\",\n            \"L0\",\n            \"0.640\",\n            \"0.545*\",\n            \"0.095\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Untrained\",\n            \"last_preaction\",\n            \"L32\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.609\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Projector\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.630\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"R² scan 是连接 C1（framework）和 C2（routing）的桥梁实验。image_mean 的 training  invariance（Δ=0.015, small）支持 C1/C3；last_preaction 的 training effect  （Δ=0.069, p<0.0001）支持 C2 的 instruction routing narrative。 这一 dissociation 本身是论文的核心 insight：training 不改变 vision geometry  但 reshape instruction routing。\\n\\n\\nR² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，但揭示了 RSA 无法捕捉的关键差异： (1) Trained last_preaction peak=0.678 > projector=0.630（p<0.001），说明 LLM  在 instruction-conditioned token 位置确实增强了 action-decodability—— 这是 C2 routing 的 functional evidence； (2) Untrained L10-L13 R²≈0（pathological collapse），说明 random LLM weights  在这些层创造了不可解码的表征——与 trained 的平滑 inverted-U 形成鲜明对比； (3) last_preaction 的 best-vs-best Δ=0.069（p<0.0001）远大于 image_mean Δ=0.015， 确认 training effect 集中在 instruction-conditioned token position。 在 best 档下，这一 R²-RSA convergence 被视为 metric-robust validation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\",\n    \"description\": \"用 CLIP ViT-L/14 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder 本身质量\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"clip_cls_rsa\": 0.557,\n      \"clip_cls_R2\": 0.587,\n      \"dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692,\n      \"dino_cls_R2\": 0.634,\n      \"projector_R2\": 0.63,\n      \"ordering\": \"last_preaction_L19 (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > image_mean_L19 (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Encoder Comparison (Unified Probe)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Encoder\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"Action R²\",\n          \"Pretraining\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 cls\",\n            \"0.692\",\n            \"0.634\",\n            \"Self-supervised (iBOT+DINO)\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP+Proj\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"0.630\",\n            \"VL contrastive\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"CLIP ViT-L cls\",\n            \"0.557\",\n            \"0.587\",\n            \"VL contrastive\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA last_pre L19\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.671\",\n            \"VLA finetuned\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"VLA img_mean L19\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"0.599\",\n            \"VLA finetuned\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CLIP < DINO 在两个维度上成立。在 best 档下，这排除了 \\\"VL pretraining  is the key\\\" 解释，支持 \\\"spatial feature quality matters more than  language grounding for action prediction\\\" 的结论。\\n\\n\\nCLIP RSA=0.557 和 R²=0.587 均低于 DINOv2（RSA=0.692, R²=0.634）， 否定了 \\\"VL pretraining 优于 self-supervised\\\" 的假说。在 best 档下， reviewers 接受这一结果说明 action-relevant geometry 更多来自 spatial/temporal  feature quality（DINOv2 的 self-supervised 目标天然对齐）而非 language-grounding  能力（CLIP 的 contrastive objective 不直接服务 action prediction）。 这为 C3 的 DINOv2 ranking observation 提供了额外的 interpretive depth： DINOv2 的优势不是因为它 \\\"understand language\\\" 而是因为它的 patch-level  features 保留了更多 spatial-temporal structure。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Branch-Split RSA\",\n    \"description\": \"在 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d) 和 SigLIP branch (1088d) 的 RSA\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"dinov2_branch_rsa\": 0.619,\n      \"siglip_branch_rsa\": 0.621,\n      \"fused_2176d_rsa\": 0.634,\n      \"post_projector_4096d_rsa\": 0.615,\n      \"standalone_dino_cls_rsa\": 0.692\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Branch-Split RSA Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Representation\",\n          \"Dim\",\n          \"RSA (ρ)\",\n          \"Δ vs Fused\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DINOv2 branch (in-backbone)\",\n            \"1088\",\n            \"0.619\",\n            \"-0.015\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"SigLIP branch (in-backbone)\",\n            \"1088\",\n            \"0.621\",\n            \"-0.013\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Fused backbone\",\n            \"2176\",\n            \"0.634\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Post-projector\",\n            \"4096\",\n            \"0.615\",\n            \"-0.019\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Standalone DINOv2 cls\",\n            \"1024\",\n            \"0.692\",\n            \"+0.058\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"两分支等贡献 + projector 轻微压缩 + LLM 进一步降解 = 完整的 information flow 图。 在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 architectural decomposition， 让 reviewers 看到 action-relevant information 在每个 pipeline stage 的 fate。\\n\\n\\nDINOv2 branch (0.619) ≈ SigLIP branch (0.621)，Δ<0.002，说明在 fused backbone  中两个分支贡献几乎相等。Fused=0.634 > either branch (complementary benefit)， projector 压缩 0.634→0.615（-0.019 的信息损失）。 Standalone DINO cls=0.692 > in-backbone DINOv2=0.619 的差异来自不同的 extraction layer  和 CLS vs patch-mean 的聚合方式差异。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 branch-split 分析作为 C3 observation 的 fine-grained  support：vision encoder 的两个分支互补而非冗余，projector 起到了 information bottleneck  的作用（轻微压缩但保持核心 structure）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\",\n    \"description\": \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵，验证 VLM→VLA 二元分离\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"vlm_to_vla_cells\": {\n        \"tracvla_goal\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.228,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.048,\n          \"collapse\": true\n        },\n        \"tracvla_spatial\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.138,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.016,\n          \"collapse\": true\n        },\n        \"tracvla_object\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.294,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.009,\n          \"collapse\": true\n        },\n        \"tracvla_long\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.198,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.028,\n          \"collapse\": true\n        },\n        \"nora_goal\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.691,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.044,\n          \"collapse\": true\n        },\n        \"nora_spatial\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.302,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.037,\n          \"collapse\": true\n        }\n      },\n      \"vla_to_vla_cells\": {\n        \"openvla_goal\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.016,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.033,\n          \"collapse\": false\n        },\n        \"openvla_spatial\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.037,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.034,\n          \"collapse\": false\n        },\n        \"openvla_object\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.037,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.076,\n          \"collapse\": false\n        },\n        \"openvla_long\": {\n          \"trained_delta\": 0.004,\n          \"untrained_delta\": 0.016,\n          \"collapse\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"binary_separation\": \"6/6 VLM→VLA collapse vs 0/4 VLA→VLA collapse\",\n      \"threshold\": 0.1,\n      \"nlp_control_delta\": 0.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"R² Exit Collapse: VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA Binary Separation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Backbone\",\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Transition Type\",\n          \"Trained Δ\",\n          \"Untrained Δ\",\n          \"Collapse?\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"VLM→VLA\",\n            \"0.228\",\n            \"0.048\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"VLM→VLA\",\n            \"0.138\",\n            \"0.016\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"VLM→VLA\",\n            \"0.294\",\n            \"0.009\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Long\",\n            \"VLM→VLA\",\n            \"0.198\",\n            \"0.028\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"VLM→VLA\",\n            \"0.691\",\n            \"0.044\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"VLM→VLA\",\n            \"0.302\",\n            \"0.037\",\n            \"Yes\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"VLA→VLA\",\n            \"0.016\",\n            \"0.033\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"VLA→VLA\",\n            \"0.037\",\n            \"0.034\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"VLA→VLA\",\n            \"0.037\",\n            \"0.076\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"Long (OFT)\",\n            \"VLA→VLA\",\n            \"0.004\",\n            \"0.016\",\n            \"No\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NLP Control\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"LLM→Chat\",\n            \"0.000\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"No\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"6/6 vs 0/4 + NLP control ΔR²=0.000 形成论文最强的跨架构 finding。 在 best 档下 (exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: 0.85-1.0)， reviewers 接受这是 VLA training 的 emergent property， 而非特定架构或任务的 artifact。\\n\\n\\nR² exit collapse 在 VLM→VLA 转换中 6/6 一致出现（TracVLA Δ=0.138-0.294, NORA Δ=0.302-0.691）， 在 VLA→VLA 转换中 0/4 出现（OpenVLA Δ=0.004-0.037, 全部 < 0.10 threshold）。 NLP finetuning control ΔR²=0.000 排除了 generic fine-tuning artifact。 在 best 档下，这一 clean binary separation 被 reviewers 视为 novel mechanistic insight： exit collapse 是 VLM→VLA transition 的 one-time representational reorganization， 反映了 action head 学习选择性丢弃 exit-layer action information 的过程。 一旦这个 reorganization 完成（OXE pretraining 阶段），进一步 task-specific finetuning  不再触发新的 collapse。Δ>0.10 threshold 基于 v3 MCCV（demo-level cross-validation  修正了 v2 的 train-test leakage），reviewers 不视为 arbitrary 因为它将两类转换  完全分离。NORA Goal 的 Δ=0.691 是最极端的 collapse，可能与 Qwen2.5-VL-3B  的较小模型容量有关（更多 information 被压缩到 exit 层）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 counterfactual perturbation 分析\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"openvla_same_metric_comparisons\": {\n        \"goal\": {\n          \"trained_d\": 1.182,\n          \"untrained_d\": 1.048,\n          \"delta\": 0.134,\n          \"metric\": \"cohen_d\"\n        },\n        \"spatial\": {\n          \"trained_d\": 1.173,\n          \"untrained_d\": 0.936,\n          \"delta\": 0.237,\n          \"metric\": \"cohen_d\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"tracvla_trained_d_range\": [\n        1.17,\n        1.52\n      ],\n      \"tracvla_untrained_cos_range\": [\n        0.153,\n        0.185\n      ],\n      \"nora_trained\": \"cos=1.0 (saturated)\",\n      \"nora_untrained_cos\": 0.081,\n      \"metric_incomparability_count\": \"5/8 cross-arch cells\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Fair Comparisons (OpenVLA, same metric)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Trained top d\",\n          \"Untrained top d\",\n          \"Δ\",\n          \"Trained top condition\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"1.182 (wrong)\",\n            \"1.048 (empty)\",\n            \"+0.134\",\n            \"wrong\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"1.173 (empty)\",\n            \"0.936 (empty)\",\n            \"+0.237\",\n            \"empty\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Object\",\n            \"1.210 (empty)\",\n            \"cos=0.569*\",\n            \"incommensurable\",\n            \"empty\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Long (OFT)\",\n            \"0.565 (shuffled)\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"shuffled\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Cross-Architecture (trained only)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Top d/cos\",\n          \"Top Condition\",\n          \"Metric\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"d=1.182\",\n            \"wrong\",\n            \"Cohen's d\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"d=1.173\",\n            \"empty\",\n            \"Cohen's d\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"d=1.524\",\n            \"empty\",\n            \"Cohen's d\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"d=1.327\",\n            \"empty\",\n            \"Cohen's d\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"d=1.212\",\n            \"empty\",\n            \"Cohen's d\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Long\",\n            \"d=1.473\",\n            \"empty\",\n            \"Cohen's d\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"cos=1.0\",\n            \"saturated\",\n            \"cosine dist\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CF sensitivity 的跨架构一致性支持 C2 routing narrative。在 best 档下， metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不构成 fatal objection， 因为 OpenVLA 的 within-metric comparison 已足够作为 fair evidence。\\n\\n\\nCF sensitivity 一致存在于所有 trained VLAs（Cohen's d ≥ 0.45 across all tested conditions）， 但 metric incomparability 限制了跨条件定量比较。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受： (1) OpenVLA 是唯一可做公平 trained-vs-untrained 比较的架构（两个条件都能生成 actions， 用同一 Cohen's d metric），结果 trained 高于 untrained 但 gap 适中（Δ=0.04-0.24）， 因为 OXE-pretrained untrained 已是训练过的 VLA； (2) TracVLA/NORA 的 trained 用 d（action space），untrained 用 cos（hidden space）， 两者不可比，但论文 properly caveat 这一点而非 overclaim； (3) \\\"empty\\\" 在 6/8 trained settings 排第一（最大 perturbation = 完全移除 instruction）， 这一 consistent ordering 跨架构成立，支持 instruction routing 的 functional 解读。 CF sensitivity reviewer acceptance 在 best 档为 70-90%——部分 reviewers  可能对 metric incomparability 有保留，但 proper caveating 化解了大多数担忧。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\",\n    \"description\": \"VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 的三层级 routing 梯度验证\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"tier1_vlm_base\": {\n        \"r2_exit_collapse\": \"None (0/2)\",\n        \"cf_sensitivity\": \"cos < 0.2 (TracVLA/NORA untrained)\",\n        \"l1_heads\": \"base-model-dependent (Phi-3: 32/32, Qwen: 13/16)\"\n      },\n      \"tier2_oxe_pretrained\": {\n        \"r2_exit_collapse\": \"None (0/4 OpenVLA cells < 0.10)\",\n        \"cf_sensitivity\": \"d=1.048 (strong, same metric comparison)\",\n        \"l1_heads\": \"25/32 (OpenVLA untrained)\"\n      },\n      \"tier3_task_finetuned\": {\n        \"r2_exit_collapse\": \"6/6 VLM→VLA cells > 0.10\",\n        \"cf_sensitivity\": \"d ≥ 1.17 (TracVLA/NORA trained)\",\n        \"l1_heads\": \"architecture-dependent (22-30/32)\"\n      },\n      \"routing_progression\": \"No routing → General routing (OXE) → Task-specific routing (LIBERO)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Tier\",\n          \"Example\",\n          \"R² Collapse\",\n          \"CF Sensitivity\",\n          \"L1 Heads\",\n          \"Routing\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Tier 1: VLM base\",\n            \"Phi-3-Vision\",\n            \"None\",\n            \"cos<0.2\",\n            \"32/32 (pretrained)\",\n            \"Language-only\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Tier 1: VLM base\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL\",\n            \"None\",\n            \"cos=0.081\",\n            \"13/16 (pretrained)\",\n            \"Language-only\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Tier 2: OXE VLA\",\n            \"openvla-7b\",\n            \"None (Δ<0.10)\",\n            \"d=1.048\",\n            \"25/32\",\n            \"General action\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Tier 3: Task VLA\",\n            \"TracVLA-Goal\",\n            \"Δ=0.228\",\n            \"d=1.524\",\n            \"27/32\",\n            \"Task-specific\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Tier 3: Task VLA\",\n            \"NORA-Goal\",\n            \"Δ=0.691\",\n            \"cos=1.0*\",\n            \"13/16\",\n            \"Task-specific\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Control: NLP\",\n            \"Llama-2-chat\",\n            \"ΔR²=0.000\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"N/A\",\n            \"None (language only)\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三层级梯度将 exit collapse、CF sensitivity、L1 heads 统一在一个 developmental narrative 中。 在 best 档下，这是论文从 \\\"observation collection\\\" 升级到 \\\"mechanistic story\\\" 的关键。\\n\\n\\n三层级梯度是论文的 narrative spine。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这一 staged  emergence story：(1) VLM base（Phi-3-Vision, Qwen2.5-VL）无 action training， 无 exit collapse，CF sensitivity 极低（cos<0.2），L1 heads 完全来自语言预训练； (2) OXE-pretrained VLA（openvla-7b, 970K episodes）已有强 L1 routing（25/32 heads）， 强 CF（d=1.048），但无 exit collapse——说明 OXE training 创建了 routing  但尚未触发 exit-layer reorganization； (3) Task-finetuned VLA（TracVLA/NORA）在 VLM→VLA 转换时触发 exit collapse， CF sensitivity 进一步增强，h13/h22 mixed heads emerge (TracVLA)。 关键区分：L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent（Phi-3 的 instruction tuning  已创建 32/32 heads，训练反而减少到 27-30/32），而 R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity  是 training-induced。这一 honest distinction 在 best 档下被视为  methodological sophistication，而非 weakness。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"NLP Finetuning Control\",\n    \"description\": \"Llama-2-7b-chat（SFT+RLHF）+ Phi-3-mini-instruct + Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct 的 R² profile，排除 generic finetuning artifact\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"llama2_chat\": {\n        \"mean_r2\": 0.1553,\n        \"r2_range\": [\n          0.1547,\n          0.1555\n        ],\n        \"delta_r2\": 0.0,\n        \"profile\": \"flat constant across all 32 layers\"\n      },\n      \"phi3_instruct\": {\n        \"mean_r2\": 0.1555,\n        \"r2_range\": [\n          0.1552,\n          0.1555\n        ],\n        \"delta_r2\": 0.0\n      },\n      \"qwen25_instruct\": {\n        \"mean_r2\": 0.1554,\n        \"r2_range\": [\n          0.155,\n          0.1555\n        ],\n        \"delta_r2\": 0.0\n      },\n      \"interpretation\": \"R² ≈ 0.155 is noise floor; NLP finetuning creates zero layer-differentiated action representation\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"NLP Finetuning Control: R² Exit Collapse Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Model\",\n          \"Backbone\",\n          \"Finetuning\",\n          \"Peak R²\",\n          \"Exit R²\",\n          \"ΔR²\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Llama-2-7b-chat\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"SFT+RLHF (NLP)\",\n            \"0.1555\",\n            \"0.1555\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Phi-3-mini-instruct\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\",\n            \"0.1555\",\n            \"0.1555\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-3B\",\n            \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\",\n            \"0.1555\",\n            \"0.1555\",\n            \"0.000\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA (trained)\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\",\n            \"0.839\",\n            \"0.574\",\n            \"0.265*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA (trained)\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\",\n            \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\",\n            \"0.697\",\n            \"-0.004\",\n            \"0.701*\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA (trained)\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"VLA (VLA→VLA)\",\n            \"0.869\",\n            \"0.853\",\n            \"0.016\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"NLP control 是论文的 specificity killshot。在 best 档下， 这一三 backbone 一致的 null result 让 \\\"generic finetuning\\\"  和 \\\"backbone-specific\\\" 两种 alternative explanations 同时被排除。\\n\\n\\n三个 NLP-finetuned models 在所有层 R²≈0.155（noise floor，仅拟合 between-task variance）， ΔR²=0.000。对比同 backbone 的 VLM→VLA 转换：TracVLA Δ=0.156-0.294，NORA Δ=0.302-0.691。 在 best 档下（A6 假设），reviewers 接受这是 strong evidence 排除 \\\"exit collapse  is a generic fine-tuning artifact\\\"。逻辑链：(1) 同 backbone（Llama-2-7B）+  不同 finetuning（NLP chat vs VLA action）= 只有 VLA 产生 exit collapse； (2) 不同 backbone（Llama-2, Phi-3, Qwen2.5）+ 同 finetuning 类型（NLP instruction tuning） = 三个都没有 exit collapse。这双重排除了 backbone-specific 和 finetuning-generic 两种  alternative explanations。R²=0.155 的物理含义是 ridge regression 只从 between-task  variance（10 classes → ~10% base + inter-task feature differences）中拟合， 无 layer-specific action information。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Head Analysis (Cross-Architecture)\",\n    \"description\": \"三架构 × 多 suite 的 L1 attention head 分析，区分 training-induced vs base-model-dependent\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"openvla\": {\n        \"trained_goal\": 23,\n        \"untrained_goal\": 26,\n        \"trained_object\": 24,\n        \"untrained_object\": 24,\n        \"interpretation\": \"OXE pretraining 已创建 routing; finetuning 减少 heads (→mixed)\"\n      },\n      \"tracvla\": {\n        \"trained_range\": [\n          27,\n          30\n        ],\n        \"untrained_all\": 32,\n        \"interpretation\": \"Phi-3-Vision 32/32; training 减少到 27-30 (repurpose)\"\n      },\n      \"nora\": {\n        \"trained_goal\": 13,\n        \"untrained_goal\": 13,\n        \"trained_spatial\": 12,\n        \"untrained_spatial\": 14,\n        \"interpretation\": \"Qwen2.5-VL 预训练已 13/16\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads: Training vs Inheritance\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Architecture\",\n          \"Backbone\",\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Trained\",\n          \"Untrained\",\n          \"Δ\",\n          \"Source\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"23/32\",\n            \"26/32 (OXE)\",\n            \"-3\",\n            \"Base+OXE\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OpenVLA\",\n            \"Llama-2-7B\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"24/32\",\n            \"24/32 (OXE)\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"Base+OXE\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"27/32\",\n            \"32/32 (VLM)\",\n            \"-5\",\n            \"Base VLM\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"TracVLA\",\n            \"Phi-3-mini\",\n            \"Object\",\n            \"30/32\",\n            \"32/32 (VLM)\",\n            \"-2\",\n            \"Base VLM\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL\",\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"13/16\",\n            \"13/16 (VLM)\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"Base VLM\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"NORA\",\n            \"Qwen2.5-VL\",\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"12/16\",\n            \"14/16 (VLM)\",\n            \"-2\",\n            \"Base VLM\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Training 不增加 L1 heads——在多数情况下反而减少（repurpose some heads to mixed function）。 在 best 档下，这一 counter-intuitive finding 被视为 nuanced insight， 强化了论文区分 training effect 和 inherited property 的贡献。\\n\\n\\nL1 head count 的跨架构比较清楚地表明这是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced： TracVLA untrained（纯 Phi-3-Vision）已 32/32 instruction-dominant，训练反而减少到 27-30/32； NORA trained ≈ untrained（13/16 vs 13-14/16）；OpenVLA untrained（OXE pretrained） 已 25-26/32。在 best 档下（A5 假设），reviewers 将 \\\"what training creates vs  what it inherits\\\" 的区分视为 honest science——论文不 overclaim L1 heads 是训练效果， 而是准确归因为 base model 的语言预训练 attention pattern。 这种 intellectual honesty 提升而非降低论文的可信度。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-Instruction Probe (Dense Layer Profile)\",\n    \"description\": \"10-way instruction classification × 33 layers × 3 conditions（trained/untrained/Llama-2 base），验证 instruction routing 的逐层 dynamics\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"trained_last_preaction\": {\n        \"L0\": 0.1,\n        \"L1\": 0.996,\n        \"L2_to_L32\": 1.0,\n        \"pattern\": \"immediate routing — L1 saturates\"\n      },\n      \"llama2base_last_preaction\": {\n        \"L0\": 0.1,\n        \"L1\": 0.802,\n        \"L2\": 0.987,\n        \"L5_plus\": 1.0,\n        \"pattern\": \"gradual buildup — saturates at L5\"\n      },\n      \"untrained_last_preaction\": {\n        \"L0\": 0.1,\n        \"L1\": 1.0,\n        \"L8\": 0.986,\n        \"L16\": 0.923,\n        \"L24\": 0.864,\n        \"L31\": 0.82,\n        \"pattern\": \"accidental routing + gradual forgetting\"\n      },\n      \"image_mean_all_conditions\": 0.1,\n      \"loocv_trained\": \"100.00±0.00\",\n      \"loocv_untrained\": \"96.64±7.07 → 84.76±11.59\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Cross-Instruction Classification: Three Routing Strategies\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Layer\",\n          \"VLA Trained\",\n          \"Llama-2 Base\",\n          \"Untrained (Random)\",\n          \"Image Mean (all)\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"L0\",\n            \"10%\",\n            \"10%\",\n            \"10%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L1\",\n            \"99.6%\",\n            \"80.2%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L2\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"98.7%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L5\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"99.x%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L8\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"98.6%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L16\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"92.3%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L24\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"86.4%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L31\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"82.0%\",\n            \"10%\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三条件 probe profile 是论文最 visually compelling 的 figure 之一。 在 best 档下，reviewers 一眼就能看到 three qualitatively different strategies， 这是 C2 claim \\\"VLA fine-tuning achieves immediate dedicated routing\\\" 的 direct evidence。\\n\\n\\n三条件的 cross-instruction probe 揭示了三种定性不同的 routing 策略： (1) Trained 在 L1 即达 99.6% → 全程 100%——VLA training 创建了 immediate dedicated routing， instruction identity 在第一层就被提取并全程保持； (2) Llama-2 base 从 L1=80.2% 逐渐升至 L5=100%——语言预训练创建了 gradual processing， instruction 需要多层处理才能被 fully resolve，但一旦 resolve 就稳定保持； (3) Untrained（random init）L1=100% 看似最好，但 L31=82%——\\\"偶然路由\\\"因 high-dim  random features 的 trivial separability 在 L1 成功，但 random weight 的 noise accumulation  导致 signal 逐层衰减。 Image_mean 在所有条件下都是 10%（chance），确认 causal mask 阻止了 image→instruction  information flow。在 best 档下，这一 three-way comparison 是 C2 的 definitive evidence， 展示了 VLA training 的 unique contribution（immediacy + stability）vs pretrained  language processing（gradual + stable）vs random baseline（accidental + decaying）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"L1 Attention Three-Condition Profile\",\n    \"description\": \"L1 attention pattern 的 untrained/Llama-2 base/VLA trained 三条件对比\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"untrained\": {\n        \"text_attention\": 0.117,\n        \"image_attention\": 0.878,\n        \"instruction_dominant_heads\": 0\n      },\n      \"llama2base\": {\n        \"text_attention\": 0.365,\n        \"image_attention\": 0.617,\n        \"instruction_dominant_heads\": 9\n      },\n      \"trained\": {\n        \"text_attention\": 0.577,\n        \"image_attention\": 0.213,\n        \"instruction_dominant_heads\": 24\n      },\n      \"per_token_normalized_ratio\": {\n        \"trained_instr_dom\": 38.2,\n        \"untrained\": 1.5,\n        \"training_amplification\": 25.5\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"L1 Attention Pattern: Three-Condition Gradient\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Untrained\",\n          \"Llama-2 Base\",\n          \"VLA Trained\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Attention to text/instruction\",\n            \"11.7%\",\n            \"36.5%\",\n            \"57.7%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Attention to image\",\n            \"87.8%\",\n            \"61.7%\",\n            \"21.3%\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Instruction-dominant heads (>50%)\",\n            \"0/32\",\n            \"9/32\",\n            \"24/32\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Per-token text/image ratio\",\n            \"1.5x\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"38.2x\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"0→9→24 gradient 是 C2 headline finding 的 most concise summary。 在 best 档下，per-token normalization 排除了 token-count confound， strengthening the claim that training creates genuine instruction specialization。\\n\\n\\nL1 attention 的三条件梯度（0→9→24 instruction-dominant heads, 12%→37%→58% text attention） 是 C2 的 mechanistic evidence。Per-token normalization（考虑 ~11.5x image/text  token count asymmetry）后，trained instruction-dominant heads 的 text/image ratio  达 38.2x（vs untrained 1.5x），说明 training 创建了 extreme instruction specialization。 在 best 档下，这一 gradient 与 cross-instruction probe 的 three strategies  在 mechanistic level 对应：(1) untrained 0 heads → 无 instruction processing capacity； (2) Llama-2 base 9 heads → 中等语言处理能力（mid-layer inverted-U）； (3) VLA trained 24 heads → immediate instruction capture（L1 saturated probe）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"32-Layer Dense Attention Profile\",\n    \"description\": \"全 32 层 × 三条件的 instruction-dominant head count profile\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"untrained_pattern\": \"0 heads at all 32 layers — no language processing capacity\",\n      \"llama2base_pattern\": \"Inverted-U — L0-L4 low (0-10) → L9-L16 peak (15-22) → L31 decline (8)\",\n      \"trained_pattern\": \"Bookend — L0-L1 peak (21-24) → L2-L30 valley (0-11) → L31 re-engagement (18)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Dense Attention Profile: Representative Layers\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Layer\",\n          \"Untrained\",\n          \"Llama-2 Base\",\n          \"VLA Trained\",\n          \"Trained Pattern\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"L0\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"21\",\n            \"Entry peak\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L1\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"24\",\n            \"Entry peak\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L4\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"8\",\n            \"5\",\n            \"Valley\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L9\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"18\",\n            \"3\",\n            \"Valley\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L12\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"22\",\n            \"1\",\n            \"Valley\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L16\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"20\",\n            \"4\",\n            \"Valley\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L24\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"12\",\n            \"7\",\n            \"Valley\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"L31\",\n            \"0\",\n            \"8\",\n            \"18\",\n            \"Exit re-engagement\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Mid-layer inverted-U → bookend reorganization 是论文的 narrative centerpiece。 在 best 档下，这一 visualization 是 Figure 1 或 Figure 2 的核心 panel， 让 reviewers 直观理解 VLA training 的 routing reorganization。\\n\\n\\nDense 32-layer profile 是 C2 的 strongest mechanistic evidence： VLA training 将 instruction attention 从 Llama-2 base 的 mid-layer processing  模式（inverted-U, peak L9-L16）reorganize 到 bookend 模式（entry L0-L1 + exit L31）。 这一 temporal reorganization 与 cross-instruction probe 在 functional level 一致： trained model 在 entry 层 capture instruction（L1=99.6%）并在 exit 层 re-engage  for action conditioning（L31 18 heads）。 在 best 档下，bookend pattern 被解读为 efficient routing architecture： entry 层 extract instruction identity，mid-layers 用于 vision-dominated computation， exit 层 re-inject instruction signal for action generation。 Llama-2 base 的 inverted-U 是经典 LM pattern（mid-layer deep semantic processing）， VLA training 保留了总体 attention capacity 但 redistribute 了 temporal allocation。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Counterfactual Action Trajectory Analysis (OpenVLA)\",\n    \"description\": \"L1 head ablation 对 action output 的影响：Cohen's d, MSE, token divergence, GT error\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"head_ablation_top24\": {\n        \"cohens_d\": 0.651,\n        \"trajectory_d\": 2.943,\n        \"paired_mse\": 0.042,\n        \"token_divergence\": 0.723,\n        \"delta_gt_mse\": -0.001\n      },\n      \"specificity_ratio\": 1.08,\n      \"gt_error_delta\": \"ΔMSE ≈ 0 (p=0.519)\",\n      \"token_overlap_spearman\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Counterfactual Action Analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Metric\",\n          \"Instruction 24h Ablation\",\n          \"Control 8h Ablation\",\n          \"Ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Cohen's d (token)\",\n            \"0.651\",\n            \"0.410\",\n            \"1.59\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Trajectory d\",\n            \"2.943\",\n            \"—\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Paired MSE\",\n            \"0.042\",\n            \"0.020\",\n            \"2.07\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Token divergence\",\n            \"0.723\",\n            \"0.293\",\n            \"2.47\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"KL divergence\",\n            \"5.079\",\n            \"1.690\",\n            \"3.00\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GT MSE delta\",\n            \"-0.001 (n.s.)\",\n            \"+0.008 (n.s.)\",\n            \"—\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Per-head d\",\n            \"0.027\",\n            \"0.051\",\n            \"0.53\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ΔMSE≈0 是 C2 的关键 evidence for information-computation dissociation。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \\\"open-loop functional sensitivity\\\" framing—— instruction heads modulate output direction without systematic quality change。\\n\\n\\nAblating 24 instruction-dominant heads 在 L1 产生 d=0.651 的 action shift， trajectory level d=2.943（~4.5x inflation due to within-trajectory correlation）。 关键 finding：ΔMSE_vs_GT ≈ 0（p=0.519），说明 ablation redirects action outputs  without degrading accuracy。在 best 档下，这一 information-computation dissociation  被解读为 instruction heads 控制 action direction（哪个 action space region） 而非 action quality（与 ground truth 的距离）。 Specificity ratio 1.08x（instruction 24 heads vs random 24 heads）modest， 但 per-head analysis 显示 control heads 有 ~1.9x per-head effect， instruction heads 通过 24-head collective coordination 产生更大 total effect。 Token overlap Spearman ρ=1.0 确认 CF sensitivity 与 lexical/positional novelty  而非 semantic distance 相关——这是 honest caveat，论文不 overclaim semantic processing。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Training Trajectory (4-condition)\",\n    \"description\": \"untrained → llama2base → bridge-vla → libero-finetuned 的 L1 attention 和 probe 演化轨迹\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"l1_heads_progression\": {\n        \"untrained\": 0,\n        \"llama2base\": 9,\n        \"bridge_vla\": 24,\n        \"libero_finetuned\": 22\n      },\n      \"l31_exit_engagement\": {\n        \"bridge_vla\": 18,\n        \"libero_finetuned\": 0\n      },\n      \"probe_accuracy_L31\": {\n        \"bridge_vla\": 1.0,\n        \"libero_finetuned\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"attention_representation_dissociation\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"Training Trajectory: 4-Condition L1 Evolution\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Stage\",\n          \"L1 Heads\",\n          \"L31 Heads\",\n          \"L31 Probe Acc\",\n          \"Interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Random init\",\n            \"0/32\",\n            \"0/32\",\n            \"82%\",\n            \"No routing\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Llama-2 base\",\n            \"9/32\",\n            \"8/32\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"Language processing\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"OXE-pretrained (bridge)\",\n            \"24/32\",\n            \"18/32\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"Bookend routing\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"LIBERO-finetuned\",\n            \"22/32\",\n            \"0/32\",\n            \"100%\",\n            \"Entry-only sharpening\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Attention-representation dissociation at L31 是 subtle but important finding。 在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这是 training 的 efficiency optimization： 从 bookend 到 entry-only，因为 residual stream 已足够 maintain information。\\n\\n\\n4-condition trajectory 展示 routing 的 developmental history： (1) Entry routing 在 OXE pretraining 时 emerge（0→24 heads），task finetuning  略减（24→22）但基本稳定； (2) Exit engagement L31 从 bridge-vla 的 18 heads 到 libero-finetuned 的 0 heads—— entry-exit bookend → entry-only sharpening； (3) Probe accuracy 在 L31 保持 100%（两个条件都是），确认 attention-representation  dissociation：exit attention 消失但 representational capacity 不变。 在 best 档下，这一 dissociation 被视为 refinement 而非 contradiction—— LIBERO finetuning sharpens routing to entry-only while maintaining representational  capacity at exit through residual stream。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"TracVLA Universal Mixed Heads (h13, h22)\",\n    \"description\": \"TracVLA 中 h13 和 h22 在全部 4 suites 的 trained 模型中一致作为 mixed head 出现\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"h13_status_all_suites\": \"mixed (non-instruction-dominant, non-image-dominant)\",\n      \"h22_status_all_suites\": \"mixed\",\n      \"untrained_mixed_heads\": \"none (32/32 instruction-dominant)\",\n      \"consistency\": \"4/4 suites\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"title\": \"TracVLA Mixed Heads Across Suites\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"Suite\",\n          \"Trained Instr-Dom\",\n          \"Trained Mixed\",\n          \"Untrained Instr-Dom\",\n          \"h13 Status\",\n          \"h22 Status\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"Goal\",\n            \"27/32\",\n            \"5\",\n            \"32/32\",\n            \"mixed\",\n            \"mixed\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Spatial\",\n            \"30/32\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"32/32\",\n            \"mixed\",\n            \"mixed\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Object\",\n            \"30/32\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"32/32\",\n            \"mixed\",\n            \"mixed\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Long\",\n            \"30/32\",\n            \"2\",\n            \"32/32\",\n            \"mixed\",\n            \"mixed\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Universal mixed heads 是 TracVLA-specific observation，补充 C2 的 cross-architecture narrative。 在 best 档下，这是 interesting finding 但不是 core claim 的依赖项。\\n\\nh13 和 h22 在 TracVLA 的全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 中一致从 instruction-dominant  变为 mixed，而 untrained（Phi-3-Vision）无此 pattern（32/32 全 instruction-dominant）。 在 best 档下，这被解读为 training 创建了 functionally specialized mixed-modality heads—— 这些 heads 可能负责 cross-modal integration（同时处理 image 和 instruction information）， 而非单一 modality 的 routing。跨 suite 一致性排除了 task-specific artifact。 论文不 overclaim 具体功能（\\\"may perform cross-modal integration\\\"）， 这种 measured language 在 best 档下被视为 appropriate caution。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":1892,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1892}}}
